When a Pokémon is holding Normalium Z and uses its Z-Power, Conversion 2 turns into Z-Conversion 2 and fully restores the user''s HP, in addition to its usual effect as above.
Targets a single adjacent Pokémon.
These Pokémon learn Conversion 2 at the level specified. The numbers given are for
Pokémon Sword & Shield and may vary in other games; check the respective Pokédex pages for details.', 'La conversión 2 cambia el tipo del usuario a uno resistente (o inmune) al último movimiento utilizado por el objetivo, al azar.
