Guard Split averages the user''s Defense and Special Defense with those of the target. Stat boosts are not taken into account.
For example, if the user''s Defense was 100, the opponent''s was 200, and the opponent had used Screech on the user, then both Pokémon would end up with 150 Defense. Due to the stat drop, the Guard Split user''s effective Defense would now be 75 (instead of the 50 it was originally).
When a Pokémon is holding Psychium Z and uses its Z-Power, Guard Split turns into Z-Guard Split and raises Speed one stage, in addition to its usual effect as above.
Targets a single adjacent Pokémon.
These Pokémon learn Guard Split at the level specified. The numbers given are for
Pokémon Sword & Shield and may vary in other games; check the respective Pokédex pages for details.
These Pokémon can learn Guard Split as an egg move.
Their breeding groups are also shown for reference.', 'Guard Split promedia la Defensa y la Defensa Especial del usuario con las del objetivo. Los aumentos de estadísticas no se tienen en cuenta.
Por ejemplo, si la Defensa del usuario era 100, la del oponente era 200 y el oponente había usado Screech contra el usuario, ambos Pokémon terminarían con 150 de Defensa. Debido a la caída de estadísticas, la defensa efectiva del usuario de Guard Split ahora sería 75 (en lugar de 50 como era originalmente).
Cuando un Pokémon sostiene Psychium Z y usa su Z-Power, Guard Split se convierte en Z-Guard Split y aumenta la velocidad un nivel, además de su efecto habitual como se indicó anteriormente.
Apunta a un único Pokémon adyacente.
