Punishment deals varying damage based on the opponent''s stat increases. It starts at base power 60 and increases by 20 for every net stat boost of the opponent, up to a maximum of 200 (7 boosts). In other words the power is:
For example, if the opponent used Nasty Plot and Agility once each, that is a total of 4 stat increases (+2 Special Attack, +2 Speed) and Punishment''s base power will be 20 × 4 + 60 = 140.
When a Pokémon is holding Darkinium Z and uses its Z-Power, Punishment turns into Black Hole Eclipse and has base power 160.
Targets a single adjacent Pokémon.
These Pokémon learn Punishment at the level specified. The numbers given are for
Pokémon Ultra Sun & Ultra Moon and may vary in other games; check the respective Pokédex pages for details.
These Pokémon can learn Punishment as an egg move.
Their breeding groups are also shown for reference.', 'El castigo inflige daño variable según los aumentos de estadísticas del oponente. Comienza con una potencia base de 60 y aumenta en 20 por cada aumento neto de estadísticas del oponente, hasta un máximo de 200 (7 aumentos). En otras palabras, el poder es:
Por ejemplo, si el oponente usó Nasty Plot y Agility una vez cada uno, eso es un total de 4 aumentos de estadísticas (+2 Special Attack, +2 Speed) y el poder base de Punishment será 20 × 4 + 60 = 140.
Cuando un Pokémon sostiene Darkinium Z y usa su Z-Power, Punishment se convierte en Black Hole Eclipse y tiene un poder base de 160.
