INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG001', 'Grass', 'Planta', 'All the Pokémon in this group (previously known as Plant) are some kind of plants; as such, nearly every member is part Grass type. Most Pokémon also belong to a second group.', 'Todos los Pokémon de este grupo (anteriormente conocido como Plant) son algún tipo de plantas; como tal, casi todos los miembros son en parte del tipo Grass. La mayoría de los Pokémon también pertenecen a un segundo grupo.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG002', 'Monster', 'Monstruo', 'Pokémon in the Monster group are large, powerful beasts. It is one of the largest and most diverse groups. Many of the starters are in this group.', 'Los Pokémon del grupo Monstruo son bestias grandes y poderosas. Es uno de los grupos más grandes y diversos. Muchos de los titulares están en este grupo.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG003', 'Dragon', 'Dragón', 'As the name suggests, the Pokémon in this group are dragon-like and reptilian in appearance. Surprisingly, less than half of the Pokémon in this group are Dragon type. Most of the Pokémon here belong to a second group too.', 'Como sugiere el nombre, los Pokémon de este grupo tienen apariencia de dragón y reptil. Sorprendentemente, menos de la mitad de los Pokémon de este grupo son de tipo Dragón. La mayoría de los Pokémon aquí también pertenecen a un segundo grupo.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG004', 'Water 1', 'Agua 1', 'The first of three water-based egg groups, Pokémon in Water 1 are generally amphibious (surviving in and out of water). All the Water type starters are in this group.', 'El primero de los tres grupos de huevos a base de agua, los Pokémon en Agua 1 son generalmente anfibios (sobreviven dentro y fuera del agua). Todos los arrancadores de tipo Agua están en este grupo.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG005', 'Bug', 'Bicho', 'As the name implies, this group consists of mainly Bug types (with the exception of Trapinch, Vibrava, Flygon, Gligar, Gliscor and Drapion). There are very few Pokémon here also in a second group, and several do not learn egg moves.', 'Como su nombre lo indica, este grupo consiste principalmente en tipos de errores (con la excepción de Trapinch, Vibrava, Flygon, Gligar, Gliscor y Drapion). Hay muy pocos Pokémon aquí también en un segundo grupo, y varios no aprenden movimientos de huevos.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG006', 'Flying', 'Volador', 'All Pokémon in this group are part Flying type, except for Decidueye. This means they are mostly bird-like in appearance. Few of these are very powerful though.', 'Todos los Pokémon de este grupo son en parte de tipo Volador, excepto Decidueye. Esto significa que en su mayoría tienen apariencia de pájaro. Sin embargo, pocos de estos son muy poderosos.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG007', 'Field', 'Campo', 'This is by far the largest egg group, previously known as Ground. As well as having many Ground type Pokémon, the Field group contains lots of land-based mammals and has the most diverse range of types. This makes for easy breeding of multiple moves. Oddly (perhaps disturbingly), this group contains Wailord, one of the largest Pokémon in existence, and some of the smallest like Skitty and Diglett.', 'Este es, con mucho, el grupo de huevos más grande, anteriormente conocido como Molido. Además de tener muchos Pokémon de tipo Tierra, el grupo de Campo contiene muchos mamíferos terrestres y tiene la gama más diversa de tipos. Esto facilita la reproducción de múltiples movimientos. Extrañamente (quizás inquietantemente), este grupo contiene a Wailord, uno de los Pokémon más grandes que existen, y algunos de los más pequeños como Skitty y Diglett.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG008', 'Fairy', 'Hada', 'Fairy Pokémon are mostly cute Pokémon, or majestic in their appearance. Pokémon X&Y introduced Fairy as a type, and so many of the Pokémon in this group are now Fairy type.', 'Los Pokémon Hada son en su mayoría Pokémon lindos o majestuosos en su apariencia. Pokémon X&Y presentó a Hada como un tipo, y muchos de los Pokémon de este grupo ahora son de tipo Hada.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG009', 'Undiscovered', 'Ninguno', 'None of the Pokémon in this group (previously known as No Eggs) are able to breed, thus do not produce any eggs. The group mostly consists of legendary and baby Pokémon.', 'Ninguno de los Pokémon de este grupo (anteriormente conocido como No Eggs) puede reproducirse, por lo que no produce huevos. El grupo consiste principalmente en Pokémon legendarios y bebés.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG010', 'Human-Like', 'Humanoide', 'The Pokémon in this group (previously known as Humanshape) are bipedal, like humans. Most Fighting type Pokémon are in this group.', 'Los Pokémon de este grupo (anteriormente conocidos como Humanshape) son bípedos, como los humanos. La mayoría de los Pokémon de tipo Lucha pertenecen a este grupo.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG011', 'Water 3', 'Agua 3', 'The last of three water egg groups, Water 3 is a mix of different Pokémon types, including fossil Pokémon, crabs and invertebrates.', 'El último de los tres grupos de huevos de agua, Water 3 es una mezcla de diferentes tipos de Pokémon, incluidos Pokémon fósiles, cangrejos e invertebrados.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG012', 'Mineral', 'Mineral', 'As expected, Mineral Pokémon are mostly based on inanimate objects. Most are Rock and Steel type. The majority of Pokémon here are only in this group and many are genderless, making for difficult breeding.', 'Como era de esperar, los Pokémon Minerales se basan principalmente en objetos inanimados. La mayoría son del tipo Roca y Acero. La mayoría de los Pokémon aquí están solo en este grupo y muchos no tienen género, lo que dificulta la reproducción.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG013', 'Amorphous', 'Amorfo', 'Amorphous Pokémon (previously known as Indeterminate) are not usually based on real creatures; instead they comprise shapeless blobs or gases. Most Ghost and Poison Pokémon are here.', 'Los Pokémon amorfos (anteriormente conocidos como Indeterminados) no suelen estar basados ​​en criaturas reales; en cambio, comprenden manchas o gases sin forma. La mayoría de los Pokémon Fantasma y Veneno están aquí.');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG014', 'Water 2', 'Agua 2', 'The second of three water egg groups. The Pokémon here are generally based on fish, and as expected all are Water type (except for Inkay/Malamar).', 'El segundo de los tres grupos de huevos de agua. Los Pokémon aquí generalmente se basan en peces y, como era de esperar, todos son de tipo agua (excepto Inkay / Malamar).');
INSERT INTO public.grupos_huevo VALUES ('EG015', 'Ditto', 'Ditto', 'Unsurprisingly, this egg group contains Ditto! Technically this is a real egg group but it''s more of a meta-group. Ditto can breed with all Pokémon besides itself and the Undiscovered group.', 'Como era de esperar, este grupo de huevos contiene Ditto! Técnicamente, este es un grupo huevo real, pero es más un metagrupo. Ditto puede reproducirse con todos los Pokémon además de él mismo y el grupo Undiscovered.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0001', 'Adaptability', 'Adaptable', 4, 'Powers up moves of the same type.', 'Activa movimientos del mismo tipo.', 'Adaptability increases the effectiveness of STAB moves from the usual 1.5× to 2×.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0002', 'Aerilate', 'Piel Celeste', 6, 'Turns Normal-type moves into Flying-type moves.', 'Convierte los movimientos de tipo Normal en movimientos de tipo Volador.', 'Aerilate causes all Normal-type attacking moves used by the Pokémon to become Flying-type, and increase in power by 20%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0003', 'Aftermath', 'Resquicio', 4, 'Damages the attacker landing the finishing hit.', 'Daña al atacante que da el golpe final.', 'If an attacker faints a Pokémon with Aftermath using a contact move, the attacker will lose 1⁄4 of their maximum HP.', 'Si un atacante debilita a un Pokémon con Aftermath usando un movimiento de contacto, el atacante perderá 1⁄4 de su HP máximo.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0004', 'Air Lock', 'Bucle Aire', 3, 'Eliminates the effects of weather.', 'Elimina los efectos del clima.', 'Air Lock suppresses all effects brought on by weather, including move power increases, end-of-turn damage, accuracy changes, relevant abilities and so on.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0005', 'Analytic', 'Cálculo Final', 5, 'Boosts move power when the Pokémon moves last.', 'Aumenta el poder de movimiento cuando el Pokémon se mueve en último lugar.', 'Boosts move power when the Pokémon moves last.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0006', 'Anger Point', 'Irascible', 4, 'Maxes Attack after taking a critical hit.', 'Maxes Attack después de recibir un golpe crítico.', 'Anger Point raises the ability-bearer''s Attack to its maximum level - +6 stages or 4× usual power - when a move targeting it receives a critical hit.', 'El Punto de ira aumenta el Ataque del portador de la habilidad a su nivel máximo (+6 etapas o 4 veces el poder habitual) cuando un movimiento que lo tiene como objetivo recibe un golpe crítico.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0007', 'Anger Shell', NULL, 9, 'Lowers Defense/Sp. Def and raises Attack/Sp. Atk/Speed when HP drops below half.', 'Disminuye Defensa/Esp. Def y aumenta Attack/Sp. Atk/Velocidad cuando HP cae por debajo de la mitad.', 'When the Pokémon''s HP drops below half, Anger Shell lowers its Defense and Special Defense but its Attack, Special Attack and Speed are raised.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0008', 'Anticipation', 'Anticipación', 4, 'Senses a foe''s dangerous moves.', 'Detecta los movimientos peligrosos de un enemigo.', 'A Pokémon with Anticipation will shudder upon entering battle, if an opponent has a move that is super-effective against it, or a One-Hit-KO move (Fissure, Horn Drill, Guillotine or Sheer Cold). It only activates when the ability-bearer switches in, not when an opponent switches in.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0009', 'Arena Trap', 'Trampa Arena', 3, 'Prevents the foe from fleeing.', 'Evita que el enemigo huya.', 'Arena Trap prevents opponents from fleeing or switching out. Raised Pokémon are not affected.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0010', 'Armor Tail', NULL, 9, 'Prevents opponent using priority moves.', 'Evita que el oponente use movimientos prioritarios.', 'Armor Tail prevents the opponent from using any moves that have priority, such as Quick Attack.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0011', 'Aroma Veil', 'Velo Aroma', 6, 'Protects allies from attacks that limit their move choices.', 'Protege a los aliados de los ataques que limitan sus opciones de movimiento.', 'Protects allies from attacks that limit their move choices.', 'Protege a los aliados de los ataques que limitan sus opciones de movimiento.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0012', 'As One', 'Unidad Ecuestre', 8, 'Combines Unnerve and Chilling Neigh/Grim Neigh', 'Combina Unnerve y Chilling Neigh/Grim Neigh', 'Combines Unnerve and Chilling Neigh/Grim Neigh
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0013', 'Aura Break', 'Rompeaura', 6, 'Reduces power of Dark- and Fairy-type moves.', 'Reduce el poder de los movimientos de tipo oscuro y hada.', 'Aura Break cancels the effects of the abilities Fairy Aura and Dark Aura and instead reduces the power of Dark-type and Fairy-type moves by 25%, for all Pokémon on the field.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0014', 'Bad Dreams', 'Mal Sueño', 4, 'Reduces a sleeping foe''s HP.', 'Reduce el HP de un enemigo durmiente.', 'Bad Dreams causes all sleeping opponents to lose 1⁄8 of their maximum HP at the end of each turn.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0015', 'Ball Fetch', 'Recogebolas', 8, 'Retrieves a Poké Ball from a failed throw.', 'Recupera una Poké Ball de un lanzamiento fallido.', 'If the Pokémon is not holding an item, it will fetch the Poké Ball from the first failed throw of the battle.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0016', 'Battery', 'Batería', 7, 'Raises power of teammates'' Special moves.', 'Aumenta el poder de los movimientos especiales de los compañeros de equipo.', 'Battery allows the Pokémon to raise the power of teammates'' special moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0017', 'Battle Armor', 'Armadura Batalla', 3, 'The Pokémon is protected against critical hits.', 'El Pokémon está protegido contra golpes críticos.', 'Battle Armor prevents the Pokémon from receiving a critical hit.', 'Battle Armor evita que el Pokémon reciba un golpe crítico.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0018', 'Battle Bond', 'Fuerte Afecto', 7, 'Transform into Ash-Greninja after causing opponent to faint.', 'Transfórmate en Ash-Greninja después de hacer que el oponente se desmaye.', 'Battle Bond causes Greninja to transform into Ash-Greninja when it KOs an opponent.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0019', 'Beads of Ruin', NULL, 9, 'Lowers Special Defense of all Pokémon except itself.', 'Reduce la Defensa Especial de todos los Pokémon excepto de sí mismo.', 'Lowers Special Defense of all Pokémon except itself.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0020', 'Beast Boost', 'Ultraimpulso', 7, 'The Pokémon boosts its most proficient stat each time it knocks out a Pokémon.', 'El Pokémon aumenta su estadística más competente cada vez que noquea a un Pokémon.', 'The Pokémon boosts its most proficient stat each time it knocks out a Pokémon.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0021', 'Berserk', 'Cólera', 7, 'Raises Special Attack when HP drops below half.', 'Aumenta el ataque especial cuando HP cae por debajo de la mitad.', 'Berserk raises the Pokémon''s Special Attack by one stage when its HP falls below 50%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0022', 'Big Pecks', 'Sacapecho', 5, 'Protects the Pokémon from Defense-lowering attacks.', 'Protege al Pokémon de los ataques que reducen la defensa.', 'Big Pecks prevents the ability-bearer''s Defense stat from being lowered, for example via Tail Whip.', 'Big Pecks evita que la estadística de defensa del portador de la habilidad se reduzca, por ejemplo, a través de Tail Whip.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0023', 'Blaze', 'Mar Llamas', 3, 'Powers up Fire-type moves in a pinch.', 'Potencia los movimientos tipo fuego en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.', 'Blaze increases the power of Fire-type moves by 50% (1.5×) when the ability-bearer''s HP falls below a third of its maximum (known in-game as in a pinch).', 'Blaze aumenta la potencia de los movimientos de tipo Fuego en un 50% (1,5x) cuando el HP del portador de la habilidad cae por debajo de un tercio de su máximo (conocido en el juego como en un apuro).');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0024', 'Bulletproof', 'Antibalas', 6, 'Protects the Pokémon from ball and bomb moves.', 'Protege al Pokémon de los movimientos de bolas y bombas.', 'Bulletproof makes the Pokémon immune to ball and bomb moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0025', 'Cheek Pouch', 'Carrillo', 6, 'Restores additional HP when a Berry is consumed.', 'Restaura HP adicional cuando se consume una baya.', 'Cheek Pouch restores the bearer''s HP when a Berry is consumed, on top of the berry''s usual effects.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0026', 'Chilling Neigh', 'Relincho Blanco', 8, 'Boosts Attack after knocking out a Pokémon.', 'Aumenta el ataque después de noquear a un Pokémon.', 'Boosts Attack after knocking out a Pokémon.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0027', 'Chlorophyll', 'Clorofila', 3, 'Boosts the Pokémon''s Speed in sunshine.', 'Aumenta la velocidad del Pokémon a la luz del sol.', 'Chlorophyll doubles the ability-bearer''s Speed during bright sunshine.', 'La clorofila duplica la velocidad del portador de la habilidad durante la luz del sol.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0028', 'Clear Body', 'Cuerpo Puro', 3, 'Prevents other Pokémon from lowering its stats.', 'Evita que otros Pokémon bajen sus estadísticas.', 'Prevents other Pokémon from lowering its stats.', 'Evita que otros Pokémon bajen sus estadísticas.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0029', 'Cloud Nine', 'Aclimatación', 3, 'Eliminates the effects of weather.', 'Elimina los efectos del clima.', 'Cloud Nine suppresses all effects brought on by weather, including move power increases, end-of-turn damage, accuracy changes, relevant abilities and so on.', 'Cloud Nine suprime todos los efectos provocados por el clima, incluidos los aumentos de poder de movimiento, el daño al final del turno, los cambios de precisión, las habilidades relevantes, etc.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0030', 'Color Change', 'Cambio Color', 3, 'Changes the Pokémon''s type to the foe''s move.', 'Cambia el tipo de Pokémon al movimiento del enemigo.', 'Color Change changes the ability-bearer''s type, when hit by a damage dealing move, to the type of that move. For example being hit by X Scissor will change the Pokémon to Bug-type. Dual-type Pokémon change to single-types.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0031', 'Comatose', 'Letargo Perenne', 7, 'The Pokémon is always asleep but can still attack.', 'El Pokémon siempre está dormido pero aún puede atacar.', 'Comatose causes the Pokémon to behave as if it were asleep, though it doesn''t officially have the Sleep status condition. It can still use its regular moves, but cannot be inflicted with any major status condition (sleep, poison, paralysis, burn, or freeze).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0032', 'Commander', NULL, 9, 'Goes inside the mouth of an ally Dondozo if one is on the field.', 'Entra en la boca de un aliado Dondozo si uno está en el campo.', 'Goes inside the mouth of an ally Dondozo if one is on the field.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0033', 'Competitive', 'Tenacidad', 6, 'Sharply raises Special Attack when the Pokémon''s stats are lowered.', 'Aumenta bruscamente el ataque especial cuando se reducen las estadísticas del Pokémon.', 'Competitive raises the ability-bearer''s Special Attack by two stages when hit by a stat-lowering move.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0034', 'Compound Eyes', 'Ojo Compuesto', 3, 'The Pokémon''s accuracy is boosted.', 'La precisión del Pokémon aumenta.', 'Compound Eyes raises the ability-bearer''s accuracy by 30%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0035', 'Contrary', 'Respondón', 5, 'Makes stat changes have an opposite effect.', 'Hace que los cambios de estadísticas tengan un efecto opuesto.', 'Makes stat changes have an opposite effect.', 'Hace que los cambios de estadísticas tengan un efecto opuesto.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0036', 'Corrosion', 'Corrosión', 7, 'The Pokémon can poison Steel and Poison types.', 'Los Pokémon pueden envenenar a los tipos Acero y Veneno.', 'Corrosion allows the bearer to poison any Pokémon, including Steel and Poison types.', 'La corrosión permite al portador envenenar a cualquier Pokémon, incluidos los tipos Acero y Veneno.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0037', 'Costar', NULL, 9, 'Copies ally''s stat changes on entering battle.', 'Copia los cambios de estadísticas del aliado al entrar en batalla.', 'Copies ally''s stat changes on entering battle.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0038', 'Cotton Down', 'Pelusa', 8, 'Lowers foe''s Speed when hit.', 'Reduce la velocidad del enemigo cuando es golpeado.', 'When a Pokémon with Cotton Down is hit by an attack, it lowers the attacker''s Speed.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0039', 'Cud Chew', NULL, 9, 'Can eat the same Berry twice.', 'Puede comer la misma baya dos veces.', 'Cud Chew causes the Pokémon to reuse an already consumed Berry at the end of the next turn.', 'Cud Chew hace que el Pokémon reutilice una baya ya consumida al final del siguiente turno.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0040', 'Curious Medicine', 'Medicina Extraña', 8, 'Resets all stat changes upon entering battlefield.', 'Restablece todos los cambios de estadísticas al ingresar al campo de batalla.', 'Resets all stat changes upon entering battlefield.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0041', 'Cursed Body', 'Cuerpo Maldito', 5, 'May disable a move used on the Pokémon.', 'Puede deshabilitar un movimiento usado en el Pokémon.', 'May disable a move used on the Pokémon.', 'Puede deshabilitar un movimiento usado en el Pokémon.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0042', 'Cute Charm', 'Gran Encanto', 3, 'Contact with the Pokémon may cause infatuation.', 'El contacto con el Pokémon puede causar enamoramiento.', 'If a Pokémon with Cute Charm is hit by a move that makes contact, there is a 30% chance the attacker will become infatuated. It will not infatuate Pokémon of the same gender, genderless Pokémon, nor those with the ability Oblivious.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0043', 'Damp', 'Humedad', 3, 'Prevents the use of self-destructing moves.', 'Evita el uso de movimientos autodestructivos.', 'Damp prevents all Pokémon on the field from using the moves Selfdestruct and Explosion. It also prevents damage (to the Damp Pokémon only) from the ability Aftermath.', 'La humedad evita que todos los Pokémon en el campo usen los movimientos Autodestrucción y Explosión. También previene el daño (solo al Pokémon húmedo) de la habilidad Consecuencias.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0044', 'Dancer', 'Pareja de Baile', 7, 'Copies the foe''s Dance moves.', 'Copia los movimientos de baile del enemigo.', 'When another Pokémon on the field uses any Dance move, Dancer causes the ability-bearer to use that same move immediately afterward. They will still use their own move originally selected, at the usual time (e.g. after the opponent if they are slower).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0045', 'Dark Aura', 'Aura Oscura', 6, 'Raises power of Dark type moves for all Pokémon in battle.', 'Aumenta el poder de los movimientos de tipo oscuro para todos los Pokémon en la batalla.', 'Dark Aura raises the power of Dark-type moves by 33% for all Pokémon on the field (not just the ability-bearer).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0046', 'Dauntless Shield', 'Escudo Recio', 8, 'Boosts Defense in battle.', 'Aumenta la defensa en la batalla.', 'Boosts Defense in battle.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0047', 'Dazzling', 'Cuerpo Vívido', 7, 'Protects the Pokémon from high-priority moves.', 'Protege al Pokémon de movimientos de alta prioridad.', 'Dazzling makes the Pokémon immune to high-priority moves (i.e. those with a priority above 0).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0048', 'Defeatist', 'Flaqueza', 5, 'Lowers stats when HP drops below half.', 'Reduce las estadísticas cuando HP cae por debajo de la mitad.', 'When the HP of a Pokémon with Defeatist falls below 50%, its Attack and Special Attack stats are halved.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0049', 'Defiant', 'Competitivo', 5, 'Sharply raises Attack when the Pokémon''s stats are lowered.', 'Aumenta bruscamente el ataque cuando se reducen las estadísticas del Pokémon.', 'Defiant raises the ability-bearer''s Attack by two stages when hit by a stat-lowering move.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0050', 'Delta Stream', 'Ráfaga Delta', 6, 'Creates strong winds when the ability activates.', 'Crea fuertes vientos cuando la habilidad se activa.', 'Delta Stream creates strong winds when the ability is activated (by Rayquaza Mega-Evolving).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0051', 'Desolate Land', 'Tierra del Ocaso', 6, 'Turns the sunlight extremely harsh when the ability activates.', 'Hace que la luz del sol sea extremadamente dura cuando se activa la habilidad.', 'Desolate Land creates extremely harsh sunlight when the ability is activated (by Groudon reverting to its Primal form).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0052', 'Disguise', 'Disfraz', 7, 'Avoids damage for one turn.', 'Evita el daño durante un turno.', 'Disguise allows the bearer to avoid damage for one attack, in a similar way to Substitute.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0053', 'Download', 'Descarga', 4, 'Adjusts power according to a foe''s defenses.', 'Ajusta el poder de acuerdo con las defensas del enemigo.', 'Download raises either the bearer''s Attack or Special Attack by one stage when switching into battle, base on the opponent''s defenses.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0054', 'Dragon''s Maw', 'Mandíbula Dragón', 8, 'Signature ability of Regidrago. Powers up Dragon-type moves.', 'Habilidad característica de Regidrago. Potencia los movimientos de tipo Dragón.', 'Signature ability of Regidrago. Powers up Dragon-type moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0055', 'Drizzle', 'Llovizna', 3, 'The Pokémon makes it rain when it enters a battle.', 'El Pokémon hace llover cuando entra en combate.', 'Drizzle creates a rain shower when the ability-bearer enters battle. The effect lasts 5 turns, unless it is cleared via Air Lock or Cloud Nine or replaced by another weather condition.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0056', 'Drought', 'Sequía', 3, 'Turns the sunlight harsh when the Pokémon enters a battle.', 'Hace que la luz del sol se vuelva dura cuando el Pokémon entra en una batalla.', 'Drought creates harsh sunlight when the ability-bearer enters battle. The effect lasts 5 turns, unless it is cleared via Air Lock or Cloud Nine or replaced by another weather condition.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0057', 'Dry Skin', 'Piel Seca', 4, 'Reduces HP if it is hot. Water restores HP.', 'Reduce HP si hace calor. El agua restaura HP.', 'Dry Skin causes several effects:', 'La piel seca provoca varios efectos:');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0058', 'Early Bird', 'Madrugar', 3, 'The Pokémon awakens quickly from sleep.', 'El Pokémon se despierta rápidamente del sueño.', 'The Pokémon awakens quickly from sleep.', 'El Pokémon se despierta rápidamente del sueño.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0059', 'Earth Eater', NULL, 9, 'Restores HP when hit by a Ground-type move.', 'Restaura HP cuando es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo Tierra.', 'Restores HP when hit by a Ground-type move.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0060', 'Effect Spore', 'Efecto Espora', 3, 'Contact may poison or cause paralysis or sleep.', 'El contacto puede envenenar o causar parálisis o sueño.', 'Contact may poison or cause paralysis or sleep.', 'El contacto puede envenenar o causar parálisis o sueño.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0061', 'Electric Surge', 'Electrogénesis', 7, 'The Pokémon creates an Electric Terrain when it enters a battle.', 'El Pokémon crea un Terreno Eléctrico cuando entra en combate.', 'Electric Surge creates a low-lying electric field, like the move Electric Terrain, when the Pokémon enters battle. It prevents grounded Pokémon from falling asleep, and increases the power of Electric type attacks.', 'Electric Surge crea un campo eléctrico bajo, como el movimiento Electric Terrain, cuando el Pokémon entra en batalla. Evita que los Pokémon en tierra se duerman y aumenta la potencia de los ataques de tipo Eléctrico.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0062', 'Electromorphosis', NULL, 9, 'Boosts the power of the next Electric-type move when hit by an attack.', 'Aumenta la potencia del próximo movimiento de tipo eléctrico cuando recibe un ataque.', 'Boosts the power of the next Electric-type move when hit by an attack.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0063', 'Emergency Exit', 'Retirada', 7, 'Switches out when HP falls below 50%.', 'Se apaga cuando HP cae por debajo del 50%.', 'Switches out when HP falls below 50%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0064', 'Fairy Aura', 'Aura Feérica', 6, 'Raises power of Fairy type moves for all Pokémon in battle.', 'Aumenta el poder de los movimientos de tipo Hada para todos los Pokémon en la batalla.', 'Fairy Aura raises the power of Fairy-type moves by 33%, for all Pokémon on the field (not just the ability-bearer).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0065', 'Filter', 'Filtro', 4, 'Reduces damage from super-effective attacks.', 'Reduce el daño de los ataques súper efectivos.', 'Filter reduces the damage taken from super-effective attacks by 25%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0066', 'Flame Body', 'Cuerpo Llama', 3, 'Contact with the Pokémon may burn the attacker.', 'El contacto con el Pokémon puede quemar al atacante.', 'If a Pokémon with Flame Body is hit by a move that makes contact, there is a 30% chance the attacker will become burned.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0067', 'Flare Boost', 'Ímpetu Ardiente', 5, 'Powers up special attacks when burned.', 'Potencia los ataques especiales cuando se quema.', 'Powers up special attacks when burned.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0068', 'Flash Fire', 'Absorbe Fuego', 3, 'It powers up Fire-type moves if it''s hit by one.', 'Potencia los movimientos de tipo Fuego si es golpeado por uno.', 'When a Pokémon with Flash Fire is hit by a Fire-type move, it does not deal damage but instead raises the power of the bearer''s Fire-type moves by 50%. Subsequent hits do not raise the power even more, but the effect remains while the ability-bearer is in battle.', 'Cuando un Pokémon con Flash Fire es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo Fuego, no inflige daño, sino que aumenta la potencia de los movimientos de tipo Fuego del portador en un 50%. Los golpes subsiguientes no aumentan el poder aún más, pero el efecto permanece mientras el portador de la habilidad está en batalla.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0069', 'Flower Gift', 'Don Floral', 4, 'Powers up party Pokémon when it is sunny.', 'Enciende Pokémon de fiesta cuando hace sol.', 'Flower Gift raises the Attack and Special Defense of all party Pokémon by 50% during harsh sunlight.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0070', 'Flower Veil', 'Velo Flor', 6, 'Prevents lowering of ally Grass-type Pokémon''s stats.', 'Evita la reducción de las estadísticas de los Pokémon aliados de tipo Planta.', 'Flower Veil prevents ally Grass-type Pokémon''s stats from being lowered, in double and triple battles.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0071', 'Fluffy', 'Peluche', 7, 'Halves damage from contact moves, but doubles damage from Fire-type moves.', 'Reduce a la mitad el daño de los movimientos de contacto, pero duplica el daño de los movimientos de tipo Fuego.', 'Fluffy reduces damage from contact moves by 50%, but Fire-type moves do double damage. Fire-type moves that make contact do regular damage.', 'Fluffy reduce el daño de los movimientos de contacto en un 50%, pero los movimientos de tipo Fuego hacen el doble de daño. Los movimientos de tipo fuego que hacen contacto causan daño regular.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0072', 'Forecast', 'Predicción', 3, 'Castform transforms with the weather.', 'Castform se transforma con el clima.', 'Castform transforms with the weather.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0073', 'Forewarn', 'Alerta', 4, 'Determines what moves a foe has.', 'Determina qué movimientos tiene un enemigo.', 'Determines what moves a foe has.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0074', 'Friend Guard', 'Compiescolta', 5, 'Reduces damage done to allies.', 'Reduce el daño infligido a los aliados.', 'Reduces damage done to allies.', 'Reduce el daño infligido a los aliados.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0075', 'Frisk', 'Cacheo', 4, 'The Pokémon can check a foe''s held item.', 'El Pokémon puede comprobar el objeto que tiene un enemigo.', 'The Pokémon can check a foe''s held item.', 'El Pokémon puede comprobar el objeto que tiene un enemigo.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0076', 'Full Metal Body', 'Guardia Metálica', 7, 'Prevents other Pokémon from lowering its stats.', 'Evita que otros Pokémon bajen sus estadísticas.', 'Prevents other Pokémon from lowering its stats.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0077', 'Fur Coat', 'Pelaje Recio', 6, 'Reduces damage from physical moves.', 'Reduce el daño de los movimientos físicos.', 'Fur Coat reduces damage taken from physical attacks by 50%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0078', 'Gale Wings', 'Alas Vendaval', 6, 'Gives priority to Flying-type moves.', 'Da prioridad a los movimientos de tipo Volador.', 'Gives priority to Flying-type moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0079', 'Galvanize', 'Piel Eléctrica', 7, 'Normal-type moves become Electric-type moves and their power boosted.', 'Los movimientos de tipo normal se convierten en movimientos de tipo eléctrico y su poder aumenta.', 'Normal-type moves become Electric-type moves and their power boosted.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0080', 'Gluttony', 'Gula', 4, 'Encourages the early use of a held Berry.', 'Fomenta el uso temprano de una baya sostenida.', 'A Pokémon with Gluttony will use a pinch berry when its HP drops to 50%, rather than the usual 25%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0081', 'Good as Gold', NULL, 9, 'Gives immunity to status moves.', 'Otorga inmunidad a los movimientos de estado.', 'Gives immunity to status moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0082', 'Gooey', 'Baba', 6, 'Contact with the Pokémon lowers the attacker''s Speed stat.', 'El contacto con el Pokémon reduce la estadística de Velocidad del atacante.', 'Contact with the Pokémon lowers the attacker''s Speed stat.', 'El contacto con el Pokémon reduce la estadística de Velocidad del atacante.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0083', 'Gorilla Tactics', 'Monotema', 8, 'Boosts the Pokémon''s Attack stat but only allows the use of the first selected move.', 'Aumenta la estadística de ataque del Pokémon, pero solo permite el uso del primer movimiento seleccionado.', 'Boosts the Pokémon''s Attack stat but only allows the use of the first selected move.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0084', 'Grass Pelt', 'Manto Frondoso', 6, 'Boosts the Defense stat in Grassy Terrain.', 'Aumenta la estadística de Defensa en Grassy Terrain.', 'Boosts the Defense stat in Grassy Terrain.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0085', 'Grassy Surge', 'Herbogénesis', 7, 'The Pokémon creates a Grassy Terrain when it enters a battle.', 'El Pokémon crea un terreno herboso cuando entra en combate.', 'Grassy Surge creates a low-lying grassy field, like the move Grassy Terrain, when the Pokémon enters battle. It restores the HP of grounded Pokémon each turn and increases the power of Grass type attacks.', 'Grassy Surge crea un campo de hierba bajo, como el movimiento Grassy Terrain, cuando el Pokémon entra en batalla. Restaura el HP de Pokémon en tierra cada turno y aumenta el poder de los ataques de tipo Grass.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0086', 'Grim Neigh', 'Relincho Negro', 8, 'Boosts Special Attack after knocking out a Pokémon.', 'Aumenta el Ataque Especial después de noquear a un Pokémon.', 'Boosts Special Attack after knocking out a Pokémon.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0087', 'Guard Dog', NULL, 9, 'Boosts Attack if intimidated, and prevents being forced to switch out.', 'Aumenta el ataque si se siente intimidado y evita que lo obliguen a cambiar.', 'Boosts Attack if intimidated, and prevents being forced to switch out.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0088', 'Gulp Missile', 'Tragamisil', 8, 'Returns with a catch in its mouth after using Surf or Dive.', 'Regresa con un pestillo en la boca después de usar Surf o Dive.', 'Gulp Missile is the signature ability of Cramorant. If Cramorant uses the move Surf or Dive, it returns with a fish in its mouth. If Cramorant then takes damage, it retaliates by spitting out the fish, dealing extra damage.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0089', 'Guts', 'Agallas', 3, 'Boosts Attack if there is a status problem.', 'Aumenta el ataque si hay un problema de estado.', 'Guts raises the ability-bearer''s Attack by 50% when inflicted by a major status ailment (poison, burn, paralysis, freeze or sleep). If burnt, the Pokémon does not suffer the usual drop in Attack.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0090', 'Hadron Engine', NULL, 9, 'Creates an Electric Terrain when entering battle, and boosts Special Attack while active.', 'Crea un terreno eléctrico al entrar en batalla y aumenta el ataque especial mientras está activo.', 'Creates an Electric Terrain when entering battle, and boosts Special Attack while active.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0091', 'Harvest', 'Cosecha', 5, 'May create another Berry after one is used.', 'Puede crear otra baya después de usar una.', 'May create another Berry after one is used.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0092', 'Healer', 'Alma Cura', 5, 'May heal an ally''s status conditions.', 'Puede curar las condiciones de estado de un aliado.', 'May heal an ally''s status conditions.', 'Puede curar las condiciones de estado de un aliado.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0093', 'Heatproof', 'Ignífugo', 4, 'Weakens the power of Fire-type moves.', 'Debilita el poder de los movimientos de tipo Fuego.', 'Heatproof reduces the damage taken from Fire-type moves by 50%. It also halves the damage from a burn, from 1⁄8 to 1⁄16 of the Pokémon''s maximum HP.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0094', 'Heavy Metal', 'Metal Pesado', 5, 'Doubles the Pokémon''s weight.', 'Duplica el peso del Pokémon.', 'Heavy Metal doubles the Pokémon''s weight in battle. Increasing weight affects these moves:', 'Heavy Metal duplica el peso del Pokémon en la batalla. El aumento de peso afecta estos movimientos:');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0095', 'Honey Gather', 'Recogemiel', 4, 'The Pokémon may gather Honey from somewhere.', 'Los Pokémon pueden recolectar miel de algún lugar.', 'Honey Gather has no effect in battle.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0096', 'Huge Power', 'Potencia', 3, 'Raises the Pokémon''s Attack stat.', 'Aumenta la estadística de ataque del Pokémon.', 'Raises the Pokémon''s Attack stat.', 'Aumenta la estadística de ataque del Pokémon.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0097', 'Hunger Switch', 'Mutapetito', 8, 'Changes forms each turn.', 'Cambia de forma cada turno.', 'Hunger Switch causes Morpeko to change its form each turn, alternating between Full Belly Mode and Hangry Mode. Morpeko''s form also changes the type of its signature move, Aura Wheel.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0098', 'Hustle', 'Entusiasmo', 3, 'Boosts the Attack stat, but lowers accuracy.', 'Aumenta la estadística de ataque, pero reduce la precisión.', 'Hustle increases the ability-bearer''s Attack by 50%, however, it also reduces the Accuracy of all Physical moves by 20%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0099', 'Hydration', 'Hidratación', 4, 'Heals status problems if it is raining.', 'Cura los problemas de estado si está lloviendo.', 'A Pokémon with Hydration will cure itself of any status conditions during rain, at the end of each turn. This includes self-inflicted conditions such as from using Rest.', 'Un Pokémon con Hidratación se curará de cualquier condición de estado durante la lluvia, al final de cada turno. Esto incluye condiciones autoinfligidas, como el uso de Descanso.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0100', 'Hyper Cutter', 'Corte Fuerte', 3, 'Prevents other Pokémon from lowering Attack stat.', 'Evita que otros Pokémon bajen la estadística de ataque.', 'Hyper Cutter prevents the bearer''s Attack stat from being lowered by other Pokémon, through moves such as Growl or abilities such as Intimidate.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0101', 'Ice Body', 'Gélido', 4, 'The Pokémon gradually regains HP in a hailstorm.', 'El Pokémon recupera gradualmente HP en una tormenta de granizo.', 'A Pokémon with Ice Body will recover 1⁄16 of its maximum HP during hail, after each turn. It also grants immunity to the hailstorm damage, if not already immune.', 'Un Pokémon con Cuerpo de Hielo recuperará 1⁄16 de su HP máximo durante el granizo, después de cada turno. También otorga inmunidad al daño de la tormenta de granizo, si aún no es inmune.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0102', 'Ice Face', 'Cara de Hielo', 8, 'Avoids damage from Physical moves for one turn.', 'Evita el daño de los movimientos físicos durante un turno.', 'Ice Face is the signature ability of Eiscue. It allows the Pokémon to take a physical attack without taking damage. After the attack, Eiscue changes to its No Ice Face form, however, it can be restored in hail.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0103', 'Ice Scales', 'Escama de Hielo', 8, 'Halves damage from Special moves.', 'Reduce a la mitad el daño de los movimientos especiales.', 'Halves damage from Special moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0104', 'Illuminate', 'Iluminación', 3, 'Raises the likelihood of meeting wild Pokémon.', 'Aumenta la probabilidad de encontrarse con Pokémon salvajes.', 'Illuminate has no effect in battle.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0105', 'Illusion', 'Ilusión', 5, 'Enters battle disguised as the last Pokémon in the party.', 'Entra en combate disfrazado como el último Pokémon del grupo.', 'When a Pokémon with the Illusion ability switches into battle, it takes the form of the Pokémon in last place (6th) of the player''s party. Illusion will not activate if the Pokémon in last place is the same species or is fainted.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0106', 'Immunity', 'Inmunidad', 3, 'Prevents the Pokémon from getting poisoned.', 'Evita que el Pokémon se envenene.', 'Prevents the Pokémon from getting poisoned.', 'Evita que el Pokémon se envenene.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0107', 'Imposter', 'Impostor', 5, 'It transforms itself into the Pokémon it is facing.', 'Se transforma en el Pokémon al que se enfrenta.', 'It transforms itself into the Pokémon it is facing.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0108', 'Infiltrator', 'Allanamiento', 5, 'Passes through the foe''s barrier and strikes.', 'Atraviesa la barrera del enemigo y golpea.', 'Infiltrator ignores the effects of Reflect, Light Screen and Safeguard. In other words, if the opponent has used Safeguard, Toxic would still badly poison them.', 'Infiltrator ignora los efectos de Reflect, Light Screen y Safeguard. En otras palabras, si el oponente ha usado Safeguard, Toxic aún lo envenenaría gravemente.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0109', 'Innards Out', 'Revés', 7, 'Deals damage upon fainting.', 'Inflige daño al desmayarse.', 'When a Pokémon with Innards Out faints, it deals damage to the opponent equal to amount of damage it took on the final blow.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0110', 'Inner Focus', 'Foco Interno', 3, 'The Pokémon is protected from flinching.', 'El Pokémon está protegido de estremecerse.', 'Inner Focus prevents the Pokémon from flinching, for example when attacked by a move like Headbutt.', 'Inner Focus evita que el Pokémon se estremezca, por ejemplo, cuando es atacado por un movimiento como Headbutt.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0111', 'Insomnia', 'Insomnio', 3, 'Prevents the Pokémon from falling asleep.', 'Evita que el Pokémon se duerma.', 'Insomnia prevents the ability-bearer from falling asleep, both from moves by other Pokémon like Sing, and self-inflicted sleep like Rest.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0112', 'Intimidate', 'Intimidación', 3, 'Lowers the foe''s Attack stat.', 'Reduce la estadística de ataque del enemigo.', 'Intimidate lower''s the Attack of all opponents by one stage when the ability-bearer switches in (including the start of a battle).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0113', 'Intrepid Sword', 'Espada Indómita', 8, 'Boosts Attack in battle.', 'Aumenta el ataque en la batalla.', 'Boosts Attack in battle.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0114', 'Iron Barbs', 'Punta Acero', 5, 'Inflicts damage to the Pokémon on contact.', 'Inflige daño al Pokémon al contacto.', 'When a Pokémon with Iron Barbs is hit by a move that makes contact, the attacker receives damage equal to 1⁄8 of their maximum HP.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0115', 'Iron Fist', 'Puño Férreo', 4, 'Boosts the power of punching moves.', 'Aumenta el poder de los movimientos de puñetazos.', 'Iron Fist increases the power of all punching moves by 20%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0116', 'Justified', 'Justiciero', 5, 'Raises Attack when hit by a Dark-type move.', 'Aumenta el ataque cuando es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo oscuro.', 'Justified raises the ability-bearer''s Attack by one stage when hit by a damaging Dark-type move.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0117', 'Keen Eye', 'Vista Lince', 3, 'Prevents other Pokémon from lowering accuracy.', 'Evita que otros Pokémon reduzcan la precisión.', 'Keen Eye prevents the Pokémon from losing accuracy, for example from moves like Sand-Attack.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0118', 'Klutz', 'Zoquete', 4, 'The Pokémon can''t use any held items.', 'El Pokémon no puede usar ningún elemento retenido.', 'The Pokémon can''t use any held items.', 'El Pokémon no puede usar ningún elemento retenido.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0119', 'Leaf Guard', 'Defensa Hoja', 4, 'Prevents problems with status in sunny weather.', 'Previene problemas con el estado en tiempo soleado.', 'Leaf Guard prevents the bearer from succumbing to major status ailments (sleep, burns, poisoning, paralysis or freezing) during sunny weather.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0120', 'Levitate', 'Levitación', 3, 'Gives immunity to Ground type moves.', 'Otorga inmunidad a los movimientos de tipo Tierra.', 'Levitate causes the Pokémon to be raised (like Flying-type Pokémon).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0121', 'Libero', 'Líbero', 8, 'Changes the Pokémon''s type to its last used move.', 'Cambia el tipo de Pokémon a su último movimiento utilizado.', 'Libero changes the Pokémon''s type to that of its previously used attack.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0122', 'Light Metal', 'Metal Liviano', 5, 'Halves the Pokémon''s weight.', 'Reduce a la mitad el peso del Pokémon.', 'Light Metal halves the Pokémon''s weight in battle. Decreasing weight affects these moves:', 'Light Metal reduce a la mitad el peso de los Pokémon en la batalla. La disminución de peso afecta estos movimientos:');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0123', 'Lightning Rod', 'Pararrayos', 3, 'Draws in all Electric-type moves to up Sp. Attack.', 'Dibuja en todos los movimientos de tipo eléctrico para aumentar Sp. Ataque.', 'Lightning Rod forces all single-target Electric-type moves - used by any other Pokémon on the field - to target this Pokémon, and with 100% accuracy. This includes the status move Thunder Wave. The ability is most useful in double/triple battles.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0124', 'Limber', 'Flexibilidad', 3, 'The Pokémon is protected from paralysis.', 'El Pokémon está protegido de la parálisis.', 'The Pokémon is protected from paralysis.', 'El Pokémon está protegido de la parálisis.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0125', 'Lingering Aroma', NULL, 9, 'Contact changes the attacker''s Ability to Lingering Aroma.', 'El contacto cambia la habilidad del atacante a Aroma persistente.', 'Contact changes the attacker''s Ability to Lingering Aroma.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0126', 'Liquid Ooze', 'Lodo Líquido', 3, 'Damages attackers using any draining move.', 'Daña a los atacantes usando cualquier movimiento de drenaje.', 'Damages attackers using any draining move.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0127', 'Liquid Voice', 'Voz Fluida', 7, 'All sound-based moves become Water-type moves.', 'Todos los movimientos basados ​​en sonido se convierten en movimientos de tipo agua.', 'Liquid Voice causes all sound-based moves used by the Pokémon to become Water type. Water type Pokémon also gain STAB from those moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0128', 'Long Reach', 'Remoto', 7, 'The Pokémon uses its moves without making contact with the target.', 'El Pokémon usa sus movimientos sin hacer contacto con el objetivo.', 'The Pokémon uses its moves without making contact with the target.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0129', 'Magic Bounce', 'Espejo Mágico', 5, 'Reflects status- changing moves.', 'Refleja movimientos de cambio de estado.', 'Reflects status- changing moves.', 'Refleja movimientos de cambio de estado.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0130', 'Magic Guard', 'Muro Mágico', 4, 'Protects the Pokémon from indirect damage.', 'Protege al Pokémon del daño indirecto.', 'Magic Guard protects the Pokémon from indirect damage, including:
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0131', 'Magician', 'Prestidigitador', 6, 'The Pokémon steals the held item of a Pokémon it hits with a move.', 'El Pokémon roba el objeto retenido de un Pokémon al que golpea con un movimiento.', 'The Pokémon steals the held item of a Pokémon it hits with a move.', 'El Pokémon roba el objeto retenido de un Pokémon al que golpea con un movimiento.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0132', 'Magma Armor', 'Escudo Magma', 3, 'Prevents the Pokémon from becoming frozen.', 'Evita que el Pokémon se congele.', 'Magma Armor prevents the Pokémon from becoming frozen, for example from moves like Blizzard.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0133', 'Magnet Pull', 'Imán', 3, 'Prevents Steel-type Pokémon from escaping.', 'Evita que los Pokémon de tipo Acero escapen.', 'Magnet Pull prevents Steel type Pokémon from switching out of battle or fleeing.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0134', 'Marvel Scale', 'Escama Especial', 3, 'Ups Defense if there is a status problem.', 'Aumenta la defensa si hay un problema de estado.', 'Marvel Scale raises the ability-bearer''s Defense by 50% when inflicted by a major status ailment (poison, burn, paralysis, freeze or sleep).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0135', 'Mega Launcher', 'Megadisparador', 6, 'Boosts the power of aura and pulse moves.', 'Aumenta el poder del aura y los movimientos de pulso.', 'Mega Launcher increases the power of all aura and pulse moves by 50%. Heal Pulse boosts the HP restored by 50%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0136', 'Merciless', 'Ensañamiento', 7, 'The Pokémon''s attacks become critical hits if the target is poisoned.', 'Los ataques del Pokémon se convierten en golpes críticos si el objetivo está envenenado.', 'The Pokémon''s attacks become critical hits if the target is poisoned.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0137', 'Mimicry', 'Mimetismo', 8, 'Changes type depending on the terrain.', 'Cambia de tipo dependiendo del terreno.', 'Changes type depending on the terrain.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0138', 'Minus', 'Menos', 3, 'Ups Sp. Atk if another Pokémon has Plus or Minus.', 'Ups sp. Ataca si otro Pokémon tiene Plus o Minus.', 'Ups Sp. Atk if another Pokémon has Plus or Minus.', 'Ups sp. Ataca si otro Pokémon tiene Plus o Minus.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0139', 'Mirror Armor', 'Coraza Reflejo', 8, 'Reflects any stat-lowering effects.', 'Refleja cualquier efecto de reducción de estadísticas.', 'Reflects any stat-lowering effects.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0140', 'Misty Surge', 'Nebulogénesis', 7, 'The Pokémon creates a Misty Terrain when it enters a battle.', 'El Pokémon crea un Misty Terrain cuando entra en una batalla.', 'Misty Surge creates a low-lying mist, like the move Misty Terrain, when the bearer enters battle. It protects all grounded Pokémon from status conditions and halves the power of Dragon type attacks.', 'Misty Surge crea una niebla baja, como el movimiento Misty Terrain, cuando el portador entra en batalla. Protege a todos los Pokémon conectados a tierra de las condiciones de estado y reduce a la mitad el poder de los ataques de tipo Dragón.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0141', 'Mold Breaker', 'Rompemoldes', 4, 'Moves can be used regardless of Abilities.', 'Los movimientos se pueden usar independientemente de las habilidades.', 'Mold Breaker prevents a target''s ability from affecting moves that the Mold Breaker Pokémon uses. It only affects abilities that change the power, accuracy or other effects of moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0142', 'Moody', 'Veleta', 5, 'Raises one stat and lowers another.', 'Sube una estadística y baja otra.', 'Raises one stat and lowers another.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0143', 'Motor Drive', 'Electromotor', 4, 'Raises Speed if hit by an Electric-type move.', 'Aumenta la velocidad si es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo eléctrico.', 'Raises Speed if hit by an Electric-type move.', 'Aumenta la velocidad si es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo eléctrico.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0144', 'Moxie', 'Autoestima', 5, 'Boosts Attack after knocking out any Pokémon.', 'Aumenta el ataque después de noquear a cualquier Pokémon.', 'Moxie increases the user''s Attack one stage upon fainting an opponent.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0145', 'Multiscale', 'Compensación', 5, 'Reduces damage when HP is full.', 'Reduce el daño cuando HP está lleno.', 'Reduces damage when HP is full.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0146', 'Multitype', 'Multitipo', 4, 'Changes type to match the held Plate.', 'Cambia el tipo para que coincida con el plato retenido.', 'Multitype changes the ability-bearer''s type if it is holding one of the Type Plate items. Moves of the corresponding type receive STAB.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0147', 'Mummy', 'Momia', 5, 'Contact with this Pokémon spreads this Ability.', 'El contacto con este Pokémon propaga esta Habilidad.', 'Contact with this Pokémon spreads this Ability.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0148', 'Mycelium Might', NULL, 9, 'Status moves go last, but are not affected by the opponent''s ability.', 'Los movimientos de estado son los últimos, pero no se ven afectados por la habilidad del oponente.', 'Status moves go last, but are not affected by the opponent''s ability.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0149', 'Natural Cure', 'Cura Natural', 3, 'All status problems heal when it switches out.', 'Todos los problemas de estado se curan cuando se apaga.', 'All status problems heal when it switches out.', 'Todos los problemas de estado se curan cuando se apaga.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0150', 'Neuroforce', 'Fuerza Cerebral', 7, 'Powers up moves that are super effective.', 'Potencia movimientos que son súper efectivos.', 'Powers up moves that are super effective.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0151', 'Neutralizing Gas', 'Gas Reactivo', 8, 'Neutralizes abilities of all Pokémon in battle.', 'Neutraliza las habilidades de todos los Pokémon en batalla.', 'Neutralizes abilities of all Pokémon in battle.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0152', 'No Guard', 'Indefenso', 4, 'Ensures attacks by or against the Pokémon land.', 'Asegura ataques por o contra la tierra Pokémon.', 'No Guard ensures that all attacks used by, and targeted at, the ability-bearer hit without fail.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0153', 'Normalize', 'Normalidad', 4, 'All the Pokémon''s moves become the Normal type.', 'Todos los movimientos de los Pokémon pasan a ser de tipo Normal.', 'Normalize causes all moves used by the Pokémon to become Normal-type, and attacking moves increase in power by 20%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0154', 'Oblivious', 'Despiste', 3, 'Prevents it from becoming infatuated.', 'Evita que se encapriche.', 'Oblivious makes the Pokémon immune to gender-based moves and abilities, specifically Attract, Captivate and Cute Charm.', 'Oblivious hace que los Pokémon sean inmunes a los movimientos y habilidades basados ​​en el género, específicamente Atraer, Captivar y Lindo Encanto.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0155', 'Opportunist', NULL, 9, 'Copies stat boosts by the opponent.', 'Copia los aumentos de estadísticas del oponente.', 'Copies stat boosts by the opponent.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0156', 'Orichalcum Pulse', NULL, 9, 'Turns the sunlight harsh when entering battle, and boosts Attack while active.', 'Hace que la luz del sol sea dura al entrar en batalla y aumenta el ataque mientras está activo.', 'Turns the sunlight harsh when entering battle, and boosts Attack while active.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0157', 'Overcoat', 'Funda', 5, 'Protects the Pokémon from weather damage.', 'Protege al Pokémon del daño del clima.', 'Overcoat makes the Pokémon immune to residual damage from weather conditions (specifically Hail and Sandstorm).', 'Overcoat hace que el Pokémon sea inmune al daño residual de las condiciones climáticas (específicamente Hail y Sandstorm).');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0158', 'Overgrow', 'Espesura', 3, 'Powers up Grass-type moves in a pinch.', 'Potencia los movimientos de tipo hierba en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.', 'Overgrow increases the power of Grass-type moves by 50% (1.5×) when the ability-bearer''s HP falls below a third of its maximum (known in-game as in a pinch).', 'Overgrow aumenta la potencia de los movimientos de tipo Grass en un 50% (1,5x) cuando el HP del portador de la habilidad cae por debajo de un tercio de su máximo (conocido en el juego como en un apuro).');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0159', 'Own Tempo', 'Ritmo Propio', 3, 'Prevents the Pokémon from becoming confused.', 'Evita que los Pokémon se confundan.', 'Prevents the Pokémon from becoming confused.', 'Evita que los Pokémon se confundan.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0160', 'Parental Bond', 'Amor Filial', 6, 'Allows the Pokémon to attack twice.', 'Permite que el Pokémon ataque dos veces.', 'Parental Bond allows the ability-bearer to attack twice. The second attack hits with 25% of the power, so in effect it is equivalent to a 25% boost to all attacks.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0161', 'Pastel Veil', 'Velo Pastel', 8, 'Prevents the Pokémon and its allies from being poisoned.', 'Evita que el Pokémon y sus aliados sean envenenados.', 'Pastel Veil prevents the Pokémon and its teammates from being poisoned. It also cures teammates of poisoning when it enters the battlefield.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0162', 'Perish Body', 'Cuerpo Mortal', 8, 'When hit by a move that makes direct contact, the Pokémon and the attacker will faint after three turns unless they switch out of battle.', 'Cuando son golpeados por un movimiento que hace contacto directo, el Pokémon y el atacante se desmayarán después de tres turnos a menos que salgan de la batalla.', 'When hit by a move that makes direct contact, the Pokémon and the attacker will faint after three turns unless they switch out of battle.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0163', 'Pickpocket', 'Hurto', 5, 'Steals an item when hit by another Pokémon.', 'Roba un objeto cuando es golpeado por otro Pokémon.', 'Steals an item when hit by another Pokémon.', 'Roba un objeto cuando es golpeado por otro Pokémon.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0164', 'Pickup', 'Recogida', 3, 'The Pokémon may pick up items.', 'El Pokémon puede recoger objetos.', 'When another Pokémon on the field uses a single-use held item, a Pokémon with Pickup will obtain the used item (if they are not already holding anything) and it can be used again.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0165', 'Pixilate', 'Piel Feérica', 6, 'Turns Normal-type moves into Fairy-type moves.', 'Convierte los movimientos de tipo Normal en movimientos de tipo Hada.', 'Pixilate causes all Normal-type attacking moves used by the Pokémon to become Fairy-type, and increase in power by 20%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0166', 'Plus', 'Más', 3, 'Ups Sp. Atk if another Pokémon has Plus or Minus.', 'Ups sp. Ataca si otro Pokémon tiene Plus o Minus.', 'Ups Sp. Atk if another Pokémon has Plus or Minus.', 'Ups sp. Ataca si otro Pokémon tiene Plus o Minus.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0167', 'Poison Heal', 'Antídoto', 4, 'Restores HP if the Pokémon is poisoned.', 'Restaura HP si el Pokémon está envenenado.', 'Restores HP if the Pokémon is poisoned.', 'Restaura HP si el Pokémon está envenenado.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0168', 'Poison Point', 'Punto Tóxico', 3, 'Contact with the Pokémon may poison the attacker.', 'El contacto con el Pokémon puede envenenar al atacante.', 'Contact with the Pokémon may poison the attacker.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0169', 'Poison Touch', 'Toque Tóxico', 5, 'May poison targets when a Pokémon makes contact.', 'Puede envenenar objetivos cuando un Pokémon hace contacto.', 'May poison targets when a Pokémon makes contact.', 'Puede envenenar objetivos cuando un Pokémon hace contacto.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0170', 'Power Construct', 'Agrupamiento', 7, 'Changes form when HP drops below half.', 'Cambia de forma cuando HP cae por debajo de la mitad.', 'Power Construct is unique to Zygarde. When Zygarde 10% Forme or Zygarde 50% Forme falls below half HP, it changes into Zygarde Complete Forme.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0171', 'Power of Alchemy', 'Reacción Química', 7, 'The Pokémon copies the Ability of a defeated ally.', 'El Pokémon copia la Habilidad de un aliado derrotado.', 'The Pokémon copies the Ability of a defeated ally.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0172', 'Power Spot', 'Fuente Energía', 8, 'Just being next to the Pokémon powers up moves.', 'Solo estar al lado del Pokémon potencia los movimientos.', 'Just being next to the Pokémon powers up moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0173', 'Prankster', 'Bromista', 5, 'Gives priority to a status move.', 'Da prioridad a un movimiento de estado.', 'Prankster increases the priority of status moves by +1.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0174', 'Pressure', 'Presión', 3, 'The Pokémon raises the foe''s PP usage.', 'El Pokémon aumenta el uso de PP del enemigo.', 'Pressure makes any attack targeted at the ability-bearer - regardless of whether it hits - use 2 PP instead of 1.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0175', 'Primordial Sea', 'Mar del Albor', 6, 'Makes it rain heavily when the ability activates.', 'Hace que llueva mucho cuando se activa la habilidad.', 'Primordial Sea creates heavy rain when the ability is activated (by Kyogre reverting to its Primal form).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0176', 'Prism Armor', 'Armadura Prisma', 7, 'Reduces damage from super-effective attacks.', 'Reduce el daño de los ataques súper efectivos.', 'Prism Armor reduces the damage taken from super-effective attacks by 25%. It is not affected by the abilities Mold Breaker, Teravolt, or Turboblaze.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0177', 'Propeller Tail', 'Hélice Caudal', 8, 'Ignores moves and abilities that draw in moves.', 'Ignora movimientos y habilidades que atraen movimientos.', 'Ignores moves and abilities that draw in moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0178', 'Protean', 'Mutatipo', 6, 'Changes the Pokémon''s type to its last used move.', 'Cambia el tipo de Pokémon a su último movimiento utilizado.', 'Protean changes the Pokémon''s type to that of its previously used attack.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0179', 'Protosynthesis', NULL, 9, 'Raises highest stat in harsh sunlight, or if holding Booster Energy.', 'Aumenta la estadística más alta bajo la luz solar intensa, o si tiene Booster Energy.', 'Raises highest stat in harsh sunlight, or if holding Booster Energy.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0180', 'Psychic Surge', 'Psicogénesis', 7, 'The Pokémon creates a Psychic Terrain when it enters a battle.', 'El Pokémon crea un Terreno Psíquico cuando entra en combate.', 'Psychic Surge creates a low-lying psychic field, like the move Psychic Terrain, when the Pokémon enters battle. It prevents high-priority moves being used and increases the power of Psychic type attacks.', 'Psychic Surge crea un campo psíquico bajo, como el movimiento Psychic Terrain, cuando el Pokémon entra en batalla. Evita que se utilicen movimientos de alta prioridad y aumenta el poder de los ataques de tipo psíquico.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0181', 'Punk Rock', 'Punk Rock', 8, 'Boosts sound-based moves and halves damage from the same moves.', 'Aumenta los movimientos basados ​​en el sonido y reduce a la mitad el daño de los mismos movimientos.', 'Boosts sound-based moves and halves damage from the same moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0182', 'Pure Power', 'Energía pura', 3, 'Raises the Pokémon''s Attack stat.', 'Aumenta la estadística de ataque del Pokémon.', 'Raises the Pokémon''s Attack stat.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0183', 'Purifying Salt', NULL, 9, 'Protects from status conditions and halves damage from Ghost-type moves.', 'Protege de las condiciones de estado y reduce a la mitad el daño de los movimientos de tipo Fantasma.', 'Protects from status conditions and halves damage from Ghost-type moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0184', 'Quark Drive', NULL, 9, 'Raises highest stat on Electric Terrain, or if holding Booster Energy.', 'Aumenta la estadística más alta en Terreno eléctrico, o si tiene Booster Energy.', 'Raises highest stat on Electric Terrain, or if holding Booster Energy.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0185', 'Queenly Majesty', 'Regia Presencia', 7, 'Prevents use of priority moves.', 'Evita el uso de movimientos prioritarios.', 'Prevents use of priority moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0186', 'Quick Draw', 'Mano Rápida', 8, NULL, NULL, 'No Pokémon have Quick Draw as a hidden ability.', 'Ningún Pokémon tiene Quick Draw como habilidad oculta.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0187', 'Quick Feet', 'Pies Rápidos', 4, 'Boosts Speed if there is a status problem.', 'Aumenta la velocidad si hay un problema de estado.', 'Quick Feet raises the ability-bearer''s Speed by 50% when inflicted by a major status ailment (poison, burn, paralysis, freeze or sleep). If paralyzed, the Pokémon does not suffer the usual drop in Speed.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0188', 'Rain Dish', 'Cura Lluvia', 3, 'The Pokémon gradually regains HP in rain.', 'El Pokémon recupera gradualmente HP bajo la lluvia.', 'A Pokémon with Rain Dish will recover 1⁄16 of its maximum HP during rain, after each turn.', 'Un Pokémon con Rain Dish recuperará 1⁄16 de su HP máximo durante la lluvia, después de cada turno.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0189', 'Rattled', 'Cobardía', 5, 'Bug, Ghost or Dark type moves scare it and boost its Speed.', 'Los movimientos de tipo Bicho, Fantasma u Oscuro lo asustan y aumentan su Velocidad.', 'When a Pokémon with Rattled is hit by a Bug, Ghost or Dark type move, its Speed is raised one stage (up to the usual maximum of +6 stages).', 'Cuando un Pokémon con Rattled es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo Bicho, Fantasma u Oscuro, su Velocidad aumenta un nivel (hasta el máximo habitual de +6 niveles).');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0190', 'Receiver', 'Receptor', 7, 'Inherits an ally''s ability when it faints.', 'Hereda la habilidad de un aliado cuando se desmaya.', 'A Pokémon with Receiver will inherit the ability of a teammate in a double/triple battle when that teammate faints.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0191', 'Reckless', 'Audaz', 4, 'Powers up moves that have recoil damage.', 'Potencia los movimientos que tienen daño de retroceso.', 'Reckless increases the power of recoil moves by 20%. By extension, this means the amount of recoil damage taken will increase as more damage is dealt (except for High Jump Kick and Jump Kick which are based on the user''s HP).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0192', 'Refrigerate', 'Piel Helada', 6, 'Turns Normal-type moves into Ice-type moves.', 'Convierte los movimientos de tipo Normal en movimientos de tipo Hielo.', 'Refrigerate causes all Normal-type attacking moves used by the Pokémon to become Ice-type, and increase in power by 20%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0193', 'Regenerator', 'Regeneración', 5, 'Restores a little HP when withdrawn from battle.', 'Restaura un poco de HP cuando se retira de la batalla.', 'A Pokémon with Regenerator restores 1⁄3 of its maximum HP when switching out.', 'Un Pokémon con Regenerator restaura 1⁄3 de su HP máximo cuando cambia.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0194', 'Ripen', 'Maduración', 8, 'Doubles the effect of berries.', 'Duplica el efecto de las bayas.', 'Doubles the effect of berries.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0195', 'Rivalry', 'Rivalidad', 4, 'Deals more damage to a Pokémon of same gender.', 'Inflige más daño a un Pokémon del mismo género.', 'Deals more damage to a Pokémon of same gender.', 'Inflige más daño a un Pokémon del mismo género.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0196', 'RKS System', 'Sistema Alfa', 7, 'Changes type depending on held item.', 'Cambia el tipo según el elemento retenido.', 'Changes type depending on held item.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0197', 'Rock Head', 'Cabeza Roca', 3, 'Protects the Pokémon from recoil damage.', 'Protege al Pokémon del daño por retroceso.', 'Protects the Pokémon from recoil damage.', 'Protege al Pokémon del daño por retroceso.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0198', 'Rocky Payload', NULL, 9, 'Powers up Rock-type moves.', 'Potencia los movimientos tipo roca.', 'Powers up Rock-type moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0199', 'Rough Skin', 'Piel Tosca', 3, 'Inflicts damage to the attacker on contact.', 'Inflige daño al atacante al contacto.', 'When a Pokémon with Rough Skin is hit by a move that makes contact, the attacker receives damage equal to 1⁄8 of their maximum HP.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0200', 'Run Away', 'Fuga', 3, 'Enables a sure getaway from wild Pokémon.', 'Permite una escapada segura de Pokémon salvajes.', 'Run Away allows the bearer to flee a battle with a wild Pokémon without fail, even if the opposing Pokémon has used a move like Mean Look or Bind, or has an ability such as Arena Trap.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0201', 'Sand Force', 'Poder Arena', 5, 'Boosts certain moves'' power in a sandstorm.', 'Aumenta el poder de ciertos movimientos en una tormenta de arena.', 'Sand Force raises the power of Ground, Rock and Steel type moves by 30% during a sandstorm.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0202', 'Sand Rush', 'Ímpetu Arena', 5, 'Boosts the Pokémon''s Speed in a sandstorm.', 'Aumenta la velocidad del Pokémon en una tormenta de arena.', 'Sand Rush doubles the ability-bearer''s Speed during a sandstorm.', 'Sand Rush duplica la velocidad del portador de la habilidad durante una tormenta de arena.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0203', 'Sand Spit', 'Expulsarena', 8, 'Creates a sandstorm when hit by an attack.', 'Crea una tormenta de arena cuando es golpeado por un ataque.', 'Creates a sandstorm when hit by an attack.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0204', 'Sand Stream', 'Chorro Arena', 3, 'The Pokémon summons a sandstorm in battle.', 'El Pokémon invoca una tormenta de arena en la batalla.', 'Sand Stream creates a sandstorm when the ability-bearer enters battle. The effect lasts 5 turns, unless it is cleared via Air Lock or Cloud Nine or replaced by another weather condition.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0205', 'Sand Veil', 'Velo Arena', 3, 'Boosts the Pokémon''s evasion in a sandstorm.', 'Aumenta la evasión del Pokémon en una tormenta de arena.', 'Sand Veil raises the ability-bearer''s evasion by 20% in a sandstorm. It also gives immunity to sandstorm damage (if they are not already protected by being Ground/Rock/Steel type).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0206', 'Sap Sipper', 'Herbívoro', 5, 'Boosts Attack when hit by a Grass-type move.', 'Aumenta el ataque cuando es golpeado por un movimiento tipo hierba.', 'Boosts Attack when hit by a Grass-type move.', 'Aumenta el ataque cuando es golpeado por un movimiento tipo hierba.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0207', 'Schooling', 'Banco', 7, 'Changes Wishiwashi to School Form.', 'Cambia Wishiwashi a Forma Escolar.', 'Schooling changes Wishiwashi into its School Form, if its HP is above 25% and Wishiwashi is at least level 20. If its HP falls below 25%, Wishiwashi will revert back to Solo Form.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0208', 'Scrappy', 'Intrépido', 4, 'Enables moves to hit Ghost-type Pokémon.', 'Permite movimientos para golpear a Pokémon de tipo Fantasma.', 'Enables moves to hit Ghost-type Pokémon.', 'Permite movimientos para golpear a Pokémon de tipo Fantasma.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0209', 'Screen Cleaner', 'Antibarrera', 8, 'Nullifies effects of Light Screen, Reflect, and Aurora Veil.', 'Anula los efectos de Light Screen, Reflect y Aurora Veil.', 'Nullifies effects of Light Screen, Reflect, and Aurora Veil.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0210', 'Seed Sower', NULL, 9, 'Turns the ground into Grassy Terrain when the Pokémon is hit by an attack.', 'Convierte el suelo en Grassy Terrain cuando el Pokémon es golpeado por un ataque.', 'Turns the ground into Grassy Terrain when the Pokémon is hit by an attack.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0211', 'Serene Grace', 'Dicha', 3, 'Boosts the likelihood of added effects appearing.', 'Aumenta la probabilidad de que aparezcan efectos adicionales.', 'Serene Grace doubles the chance of moves'' secondary effects occurring - specifically stat changes, status ailments, or flinching. It also increases the chance of flinching due to the held items King''s Rock and Razor Fang from 10% to 20% (however, note that those items do not affect moves that already have a flinch chance).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0212', 'Shadow Shield', 'Guardia Espectro', 7, 'Reduces damage when HP is full.', 'Reduce el daño cuando HP está lleno.', 'Reduces damage when HP is full.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0213', 'Shadow Tag', 'Sombra Trampa', 3, 'Prevents the foe from escaping.', 'Evita que el enemigo escape.', 'Prevents the foe from escaping.', 'Evita que el enemigo escape.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0214', 'Sharpness', NULL, 9, 'Powers up slicing moves.', 'Potencia los movimientos de corte.', 'Powers up slicing moves.', 'Potencia los movimientos de corte.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0215', 'Shed Skin', 'Mudar', 3, 'The Pokémon may heal its own status problems.', 'El Pokémon puede curar sus propios problemas de estado.', 'The Pokémon may heal its own status problems.', 'El Pokémon puede curar sus propios problemas de estado.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0216', 'Sheer Force', 'Potencia Bruta', 5, 'Removes added effects to increase move damage.', 'Elimina los efectos añadidos para aumentar el daño por movimiento.', 'Sheer Force increases the power of moves that have beneficial secondary effects by 30%, but removes those additional effects.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0217', 'Shell Armor', 'Caparazón', 3, 'The Pokémon is protected against critical hits.', 'El Pokémon está protegido contra golpes críticos.', 'Shell Armor prevents the Pokémon from receiving a critical hit.', 'Shell Armor evita que el Pokémon reciba un golpe crítico.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0218', 'Shield Dust', 'Polvo Escudo', 3, 'Blocks the added effects of attacks taken.', 'Bloquea los efectos añadidos de los ataques recibidos.', 'Blocks the added effects of attacks taken.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0219', 'Shields Down', 'Escudo Limitado', 7, 'Changes stats when HP drops below half.', 'Cambia las estadísticas cuando HP cae por debajo de la mitad.', 'Shields Down causes the Pokémon to changes its appearance and stats depending on its remaining HP.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0220', 'Simple', 'Simple', 4, 'Doubles all stat changes.', 'Duplica todos los cambios de estadísticas.', 'The Simple ability doubles the number of stages of all stat changes. Stats can be raised to a maximum of +6 stages each, or lowered to a minimum of -6 stages each.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0221', 'Skill Link', 'Encadenado', 4, 'Increases the frequency of multi-strike moves.', 'Aumenta la frecuencia de los movimientos de múltiples golpes.', 'Skill Link causes multi-strike moves to always hit their maximum number of times. The moves affected are listed below; note that moves such as Double Kick that always strike the same number of times are not affected.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0222', 'Slow Start', 'Inicio Lento', 4, 'Temporarily halves Attack and Speed.', 'Temporalmente reduce a la mitad el Ataque y la Velocidad.', 'Temporarily halves Attack and Speed.', 'Temporalmente reduce a la mitad el Ataque y la Velocidad.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0223', 'Slush Rush', 'Quitanieves', 7, 'Boosts the Pokémon''s Speed stat in a hailstorm.', 'Aumenta la estadística de Velocidad del Pokémon en una tormenta de granizo.', 'Boosts the Pokémon''s Speed stat in a hailstorm.', 'Aumenta la estadística de Velocidad del Pokémon en una tormenta de granizo.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0224', 'Sniper', 'Francotirador', 4, 'Powers up moves if they become critical hits.', 'Potencia los movimientos si se convierten en golpes críticos.', 'Sniper increases the power of critical hits by 1.5×. This means a critical hit will deal 2.25× normal damage instead of 1.5×.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0225', 'Snow Cloak', 'Manto Níveo', 4, 'Raises evasion in a hailstorm.', 'Aumenta la evasión en una tormenta de granizo.', 'Snow Cloak raises ability-bearer''s evasion by 20% in a hail storm. It also gives immunity to damage by hail (if they are not already protected by being Ice type).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0226', 'Snow Warning', 'Nevada', 4, 'The Pokémon summons a hailstorm in battle.', 'El Pokémon convoca una tormenta de granizo en la batalla.', 'Snow Warning creates a hailstorm when the ability-bearer enters battle. The effect lasts 5 turns, unless it is cleared via Air Lock or Cloud Nine or replaced by another weather condition.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0227', 'Solar Power', 'Poder Solar', 4, 'In sunshine, Sp. Atk is boosted but HP decreases.', 'En sol, Sp. Atk aumenta pero HP disminuye.', 'During harsh sunlight, Solar Power raises the ability-bearer''s Special Attack by 50%, but it also loses 1⁄8 of its maximum HP after each turn.', 'Durante la intensa luz del sol, Solar Power aumenta el Ataque especial del portador de la habilidad en un 50 %, pero también pierde 1⁄8 de su HP máximo después de cada turno.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0228', 'Solid Rock', 'Roca Sólida', 4, 'Reduces damage from super-effective attacks.', 'Reduce el daño de los ataques súper efectivos.', 'Solid Rock reduces the damage taken from super-effective attacks by 25%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0229', 'Soul-Heart', 'Coránima', 7, 'Raises Special Attack when an ally faints.', 'Aumenta el ataque especial cuando un aliado se desmaya.', 'Soul-Heart raises the bearer''s Special Attack one stage when a teammate faints.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0230', 'Soundproof', 'Insonorizar', 3, 'Gives immunity to sound-based moves.', 'Otorga inmunidad a los movimientos basados ​​en sonido.', 'Soundproof grants the Pokémon immunity to all sound-based moves, preventing all damage and effects.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0231', 'Speed Boost', 'Impulso', 3, 'Its Speed stat is gradually boosted.', 'Su estadística de velocidad aumenta gradualmente.', 'Its Speed stat is gradually boosted.', 'Su estadística de velocidad aumenta gradualmente.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0232', 'Stakeout', 'Vigilante', 7, 'Deals double damage to Pokémon switching in.', 'Inflige el doble de daño a los Pokémon que entran.', 'Stakeout enables the Pokémon to deal twice the normal damage to any Pokémon that switches in or enters the field mid-battle.', 'Stakeout permite que el Pokémon inflija el doble de daño normal a cualquier Pokémon que entre o entre en el campo en medio de la batalla.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0233', 'Stall', 'Rezagado', 4, 'The Pokémon moves after all other Pokémon do.', 'El Pokémon se mueve después que todos los demás Pokémon.', 'The Pokémon moves after all other Pokémon do.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0234', 'Stalwart', 'Acérrimo', 8, 'Ignores moves and abilities that draw in moves.', 'Ignora movimientos y habilidades que atraen movimientos.', 'Ignores moves and abilities that draw in moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0235', 'Stamina', 'Firmeza', 7, 'Raises Defense when attacked.', 'Aumenta la defensa cuando es atacado.', 'Stamina raises the bearer''s Defense by one stage when it is attacked by any move.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0236', 'Stance Change', 'Cambio Táctico', 6, 'Changes form depending on moves used.', 'Cambia de forma dependiendo de los movimientos utilizados.', 'Stance Change is exclusive to Aegislash. When using a damage-dealing move, Aegislash switches to its Blade Forme. When using the move King''s Shield, Aegislash switches to its Shield Forme.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0237', 'Static', 'Elec. Estática', 3, 'Contact with the Pokémon may cause paralysis.', 'El contacto con el Pokémon puede causar parálisis.', 'If a Pokémon with Static is hit by a move making contact, there is a 30% chance the foe will become paralyzed.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0238', 'Steadfast', 'Impasible', 4, 'Raises Speed each time the Pokémon flinches.', 'Aumenta la velocidad cada vez que el Pokémon se estremece.', 'Raises Speed each time the Pokémon flinches.', 'Aumenta la velocidad cada vez que el Pokémon se estremece.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0239', 'Steam Engine', 'Combustible', 8, 'Drastically raises Speed when hit by a Fire- or Water-type move.', 'Aumenta drásticamente la velocidad cuando es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo fuego o agua.', 'Steam Engine raises the user''s Speed by three stages when it is hit by a Fire- or Water-type attack.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0240', 'Steelworker', 'Acero Templado', 7, 'Powers up Steel-type moves.', 'Potencia los movimientos de tipo Acero.', 'Steelworker increases the power of Steel-type moves by 50%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0241', 'Steely Spirit', 'Alma Acerada', 8, 'Powers up ally Pokémon''s Steel-type moves.', 'Potencia los movimientos de tipo Acero de los Pokémon aliados.', 'Powers up ally Pokémon''s Steel-type moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0242', 'Stench', 'Hedor', 3, 'The stench may cause the target to flinch.', 'El hedor puede hacer que el objetivo se estremezca.', 'A Pokémon with Stench has a 10% chance of causing the opponent to flinch when hit by a damaging move (provided the ability-bearer strikes first as usual).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0243', 'Sticky Hold', 'Viscosidad', 3, 'Protects the Pokémon from item theft.', 'Protege al Pokémon del robo de objetos.', 'Sticky Hold prevents held items from being taken or switched.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0244', 'Storm Drain', 'Colector', 4, 'Draws in all Water-type moves to up Sp. Attack.', 'Dibuja en todos los movimientos de tipo Agua para aumentar Sp. Ataque.', 'Storm Drain forces all single-target Water-type moves - used by any other Pokémon on the field - to target this Pokémon, and with 100% accuracy. The ability is most useful in double/triple battles.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0245', 'Strong Jaw', 'Mandíbula Fuerte', 6, 'Boosts the power of biting moves.', 'Aumenta el poder de los movimientos de mordida.', 'Strong Jaw increases the power of all biting moves by 50%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0246', 'Sturdy', 'Robustez', 3, 'It cannot be knocked out with one hit.', 'No se puede eliminar de un solo golpe.', 'Sturdy allows the Pokémon to survive with 1 HP if attacked at full HP with an attack that would otherwise knock it out. It also prevents One-Hit-KO moves (Fissure, Horn Drill, Guillotine or Sheer Cold).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0247', 'Suction Cups', 'Ventosas', 3, 'Negates all moves that force switching out.', 'Niega todos los movimientos que fuerzan el cambio.', 'Suction Cups prevents opponents forcing the ability-bearer to switch out or flee via the moves Roar, Whirlwind, Circle Throw, or Dragon Tail, or the item Red Card.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0248', 'Super Luck', 'Afortunado', 4, 'Heightens the critical-hit ratios of moves.', 'Aumenta la proporción de golpes críticos de los movimientos.', 'Super Luck raises the ability-bearer''s critical-hit ratio by one stage (for most moves this increases from a 1⁄16 chance to 1⁄8).', 'Super Luck aumenta la proporción de golpes críticos del portador de la habilidad en un nivel (para la mayoría de los movimientos, esto aumenta de 1⁄16 de probabilidad a 1⁄8).');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0249', 'Supreme Overlord', NULL, 9, 'Attack and Special Attack are boosted for each party Pokémon that has been defeated.', 'El Ataque y el Ataque Especial se potencian para cada Pokémon del grupo que haya sido derrotado.', 'Attack and Special Attack are boosted for each party Pokémon that has been defeated.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0250', 'Surge Surfer', 'Cola Surf', 7, 'Doubles Speed during Electric Terrain. ', 'Duplica la velocidad durante el terreno eléctrico.', 'Surge Surfer doubles the bearer''s Speed when Electric Terrain is active.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0251', 'Swarm', 'Enjambre', 3, 'Powers up Bug-type moves in a pinch.', 'Activa los movimientos tipo Bug en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.', 'Swarm increases the power of Bug-type moves by 50% (1.5×) when the ability-bearer''s HP falls below a third of its maximum (known in-game as in a pinch).
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0252', 'Sweet Veil', 'Velo Dulce', 6, 'Prevents the Pokémon and allies from falling asleep.', 'Evita que los Pokémon y aliados se duerman.', 'Sweet Veil prevents this Pokémon and its allies from falling asleep, for example from moves like Hypnosis.', 'Sweet Veil evita que este Pokémon y sus aliados se duerman, por ejemplo, con movimientos como Hipnosis.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0253', 'Swift Swim', 'Nado Rápido', 3, 'Boosts the Pokémon''s Speed in rain.', 'Aumenta la Velocidad del Pokémon bajo la lluvia.', 'Swift Swim doubles the ability-bearer''s Speed during rain.', 'Swift Swim duplica la velocidad del portador de la habilidad durante la lluvia.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0254', 'Sword of Ruin', NULL, 9, 'Lowers Defense of all Pokémon except itself.', 'Reduce la Defensa de todos los Pokémon excepto de sí mismo.', 'Lowers Defense of all Pokémon except itself.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0255', 'Symbiosis', 'Simbiosis', 6, 'The Pokémon can pass an item to an ally.', 'El Pokémon puede pasar un objeto a un aliado.', 'The Pokémon can pass an item to an ally.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0256', 'Synchronize', 'Sincronía', 3, 'Passes a burn, poison, or paralysis to the foe.', 'Pasa una quemadura, veneno o parálisis al enemigo.', 'If the opponent causes a burn, paralysis, or poisoning of a Pokémon with Synchronize, the opponent receives the status condition too. Self-inflicted status conditions (for example through the use of an item) are not passed on.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0257', 'Tablets of Ruin', NULL, 9, 'Lowers Attack of all Pokémon except itself.', 'Reduce el Ataque de todos los Pokémon excepto de sí mismo.', 'Lowers Attack of all Pokémon except itself.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0258', 'Tangled Feet', 'Tumbos', 4, 'Raises evasion if the Pokémon is confused.', 'Aumenta la evasión si el Pokémon está confundido.', 'Raises evasion if the Pokémon is confused.', 'Aumenta la evasión si el Pokémon está confundido.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0259', 'Tangling Hair', 'Rizos Rebeldes', 7, 'Contact with the Pokémon lowers the attacker''s Speed stat.', 'El contacto con el Pokémon reduce la estadística de Velocidad del atacante.', 'Contact with the Pokémon lowers the attacker''s Speed stat.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0260', 'Technician', 'Experto', 4, 'Powers up the Pokémon''s weaker moves.', 'Potencia los movimientos más débiles del Pokémon.', 'Technician increases the power of moves - that are usually base power 60 or below - by 50%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0261', 'Telepathy', 'Telepatía', 5, 'Anticipates an ally''s attack and dodges it.', 'Anticipa el ataque de un aliado y lo esquiva.', 'Pokémon with the Telepathy ability will not take damage from teammates in double and triple battles.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0262', 'Teravolt', 'Terravoltaje', 5, 'Moves can be used regardless of Abilities.', 'Los movimientos se pueden usar independientemente de las habilidades.', 'Teravolt prevents a target''s ability from affecting moves that the Teravolt Pokémon uses. It only affects abilities that change the power, accuracy or other effects of moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0263', 'Thermal Exchange', NULL, 9, 'Raises Attack when hit by a Fire-type move. Cannot be burned.', 'Aumenta el Ataque cuando es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo Fuego. No se puede quemar.', 'Raises Attack when hit by a Fire-type move. Cannot be burned.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0264', 'Thick Fat', 'Sebo', 3, 'Ups resistance to Fire- and Ice-type moves.', 'Aumenta la resistencia a los movimientos de tipo Fuego y Hielo.', 'Thick Fat reduces the damage taken from Fire-type and Ice-type moves by 50%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0265', 'Tinted Lens', 'Cromolente', 4, 'Powers up “not very effective” moves.', 'Potencia los movimientos no muy efectivos.', 'Powers up “not very effective” moves.', 'Potencia los movimientos no muy efectivos.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0266', 'Torrent', 'Torrente', 3, 'Powers up Water-type moves in a pinch.', 'Potencia los movimientos de tipo agua en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.', 'Torrent increases the power of Water-type moves by 50% (1.5×) when the ability-bearer''s HP falls below a third of its maximum (known in-game as in a pinch).', 'Torrent aumenta la potencia de los movimientos de tipo agua en un 50 % (1,5 ×) cuando el HP del portador de la habilidad cae por debajo de un tercio de su máximo (conocido en el juego como en un apuro).');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0267', 'Tough Claws', 'Garra Dura', 6, 'Boosts the power of contact moves.', 'Aumenta el poder de los movimientos de contacto.', 'Tough Claws increases the power of moves that make contact.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0268', 'Toxic Boost', 'Ímpetu Tóxico', 5, 'Powers up physical attacks when poisoned.', 'Potencia los ataques físicos cuando está envenenado.', 'Powers up physical attacks when poisoned.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0269', 'Toxic Debris', NULL, 9, 'Scatters poison spikes at the feet of the opposing team when the Pokémon takes damage from physical moves.', 'Esparce picos de veneno a los pies del equipo contrario cuando el Pokémon recibe daño por movimientos físicos.', 'Scatters poison spikes at the feet of the opposing team when the Pokémon takes damage from physical moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0270', 'Trace', 'Rastro', 3, 'The Pokémon copies a foe''s Ability.', 'El Pokémon copia la habilidad de un enemigo.', 'The Pokémon copies a foe''s Ability.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0271', 'Transistor', 'Transistor', 8, 'Signature ability of Regieleki. Powers up Electric-type moves.', 'Habilidad característica de Regieleki. Potencia los movimientos de tipo eléctrico.', 'Signature ability of Regieleki. Powers up Electric-type moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0272', 'Triage', 'Primer Auxilio', 7, 'Gives priority to restorative moves.', 'Da prioridad a los movimientos restauradores.', 'Triage increases the priority of HP-restoring moves to +3, when used by the ability-bearer.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0273', 'Truant', 'Ausente', 3, 'Pokémon can''t attack on consecutive turns.', 'Los Pokémon no pueden atacar en turnos consecutivos.', 'Truant causes the ability-bearer to only attack every alternate turn. On the even turns, it will say the Pokémon is loafing around.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0274', 'Turboblaze', 'Turbollama', 5, 'Moves can be used regardless of Abilities.', 'Los movimientos se pueden usar independientemente de las habilidades.', 'Turboblaze prevents a target''s ability from affecting moves that the Turboblaze Pokémon uses. It only affects abilities that change the power, accuracy or other effects of moves.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0275', 'Unaware', 'Ignorante', 4, 'Ignores any stat changes in the Pokémon.', 'Ignora cualquier cambio en las estadísticas del Pokémon.', 'Ignores any stat changes in the Pokémon.', 'Ignora cualquier cambio en las estadísticas del Pokémon.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0276', 'Unburden', 'Liviano', 4, 'Raises Speed if a held item is used.', 'Aumenta la velocidad si se usa un elemento retenido.', 'Raises Speed if a held item is used.', 'Aumenta la velocidad si se usa un elemento retenido.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0277', 'Unnerve', 'Nerviosismo', 5, 'Makes the foe nervous and unable to eat Berries.', 'Hace que el enemigo se sienta nervioso e incapaz de comer bayas.', 'Makes the foe nervous and unable to eat Berries.', 'Hace que el enemigo se sienta nervioso e incapaz de comer bayas.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0278', 'Unseen Fist', 'Puño Invisible', 8, 'Contact moves can strike through Protect/Detect.', 'Los movimientos de contacto pueden pasar a través de Protect/Detect.', 'Contact moves can strike through Protect/Detect.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0279', 'Vessel of Ruin', NULL, 9, 'Lowers Special Attack of all Pokémon except itself.', 'Reduce el Ataque Especial de todos los Pokémon excepto a sí mismo.', 'Lowers Special Attack of all Pokémon except itself.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0280', 'Victory Star', 'Tinovictoria', 5, 'Boosts the accuracy of its allies and itself.', 'Aumenta la precisión de sus aliados y de sí mismo.', 'Boosts the accuracy of its allies and itself.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0281', 'Vital Spirit', 'Espíritu Vital', 3, 'Prevents the Pokémon from falling asleep.', 'Evita que el Pokémon se duerma.', 'Vital Spirit prevents the ability-bearer from falling asleep. This means that it also prevents the use of the move Rest.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0282', 'Volt Absorb', 'Absorbe Elec', 3, 'Restores HP if hit by an Electric-type move.', 'Restaura HP si es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo eléctrico.', 'A Pokémon with Volt Absorb heals 1⁄4 of its maximum HP when hit by an Electric-type attack, including Thunder Wave.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0283', 'Wandering Spirit', 'Alma Errante', 8, 'Swaps abilities with opponents on contact.', 'Intercambia habilidades con los oponentes al contacto.', 'Swaps abilities with opponents on contact.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0284', 'Water Absorb', 'Absorbe Agua', 3, 'Restores HP if hit by a Water-type move.', 'Restaura HP si es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo Agua.', 'A Pokémon with Water Absorb heals 1⁄4 of its maximum HP when hit by a Water-type attack.', 'Un Pokémon con Water Absorb recupera 1⁄4 de su HP máximo cuando es golpeado por un ataque de tipo Water.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0285', 'Water Bubble', 'Pompa', 7, 'Halves damage from Fire-type moves, doubles power of Water-type moves used, and prevents burns.', 'Reduce a la mitad el daño de los movimientos de tipo Fuego, duplica la potencia de los movimientos de tipo Agua utilizados y previene las quemaduras.', 'Water Bubble reduces damage taken from Fire-type moves by 50%, and doubles the power of Water-type moves used by the ability-bearer. It also prevents the Pokémon from being burned.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0286', 'Water Compaction', 'Hidrorrefuerzo', 7, 'Sharply raises Defense when hit by a Water-type move.', 'Aumenta bruscamente la defensa cuando es golpeado por un movimiento de tipo agua.', 'Water Compaction raises the bearer''s Defense by 2 stages when it is hit by a Water-type move.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0287', 'Water Veil', 'Velo Agua', 3, 'Prevents the Pokémon from getting a burn.', 'Evita que el Pokémon se queme.', 'Prevents the Pokémon from getting a burn.', 'Evita que el Pokémon se queme.');
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0288', 'Weak Armor', 'Armadura Frágil', 5, 'Physical attacks lower Defense and raise Speed.', 'Los ataques físicos reducen la defensa y aumentan la velocidad.', 'When a Pokémon with Weak Armor is hit by a physical move, its Defense drops one stage, but its Speed increases by one stage.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0289', 'Well-Baked Body', NULL, 9, 'Immune to Fire-type moves, and Defense is sharply boosted.', 'Inmune a los movimientos de tipo fuego, y la defensa aumenta considerablemente.', 'Immune to Fire-type moves, and Defense is sharply boosted.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0290', 'White Smoke', 'Humo Blanco', 3, 'Prevents other Pokémon from lowering its stats.', 'Evita que otros Pokémon bajen sus estadísticas.', 'Prevents other Pokémon from lowering its stats.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0291', 'Wimp Out', 'Huida', 7, 'Switches out when HP drops below half.', 'Se apaga cuando HP cae por debajo de la mitad.', 'Wimp Out causes the bearer to switch out (or flee in a wild battle) when its HP falls below 50%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0292', 'Wind Power', NULL, 9, 'Boosts power of the next Electric-type move used, when hit by a wind move.', 'Aumenta la potencia del próximo movimiento de tipo eléctrico utilizado, cuando es golpeado por un movimiento de viento.', 'Boosts power of the next Electric-type move used, when hit by a wind move.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0293', 'Wind Rider', NULL, 9, 'Takes no damage from wind moves, and boosts Attack if hit by a wind move or Tailwind is in effect.', 'No recibe daño de los movimientos de viento y aumenta el ataque si es golpeado por un movimiento de viento o Tailwind está en efecto.', 'Takes no damage from wind moves, and boosts Attack if hit by a wind move or Tailwind is in effect.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0294', 'Wonder Guard', 'Superguarda', 3, 'Only supereffective moves will hit.', 'Solo los movimientos supereficaces acertarán.', 'Wonder Guard prevents damage from direct attacks unless they are super-effective. Shedinja is the only Pokémon to have this ability so this means that only Fire, Flying, Rock, Ghost and Dark moves will have an effect.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0295', 'Wonder Skin', 'Piel Milagro', 5, 'Makes status-changing moves more likely to miss.', 'Hace que los movimientos de cambio de estado sean más probables de fallar.', 'Wonder Skin halves the accuracy of all status moves targeted at the ability-bearer.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0296', 'Zen Mode', 'Modo Daruma', 5, 'Changes form when HP drops below half.', 'Cambia de forma cuando HP cae por debajo de la mitad.', 'Zen Mode changes the ability-bearer''s form to Zen Mode when their health falls below 50%.
INSERT INTO public.habilidad VALUES ('A0297', 'Zero to Hero', NULL, 9, 'Transforms into its Hero Form when switching out.', 'Se transforma en su forma de héroe al cambiar.', 'Transforms into its Hero Form when switching out.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_movimiento VALUES ('ST  ', 'Status', 'Estado');
INSERT INTO public.tipos_movimiento VALUES ('FH  ', 'Physical', 'Físico');
INSERT INTO public.tipos_movimiento VALUES ('SP  ', 'Special', 'Especial');
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T001', 'Normal', 'Normal', 'The Normal type is the most basic type of Pokémon. They are very common and appear from the very first route you visit. Most Normal Pokémon are single type, but there is a large contingent having a second type of Flying. Pokémon X/Y add several Normal dual-type Pokémon.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T002', 'Fire', 'Fuego', 'Fire is one of the three basic elemental types along with Water and Grass, which constitute the three starter Pokémon. This creates a simple triangle to explain the type concept easily to new players. Fire types are notoriously rare in the early stages of the games so choosing the Fire variation starter is often a plus.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T003', 'Water', 'Agua', 'Water is one of the three basic elemental types along with Fire and Grass, which constitute the three starter Pokémon. This creates a simple triangle to explain the type concept easily to new players. Water is the most common type with over 100 Pokémon, which are based on a wide variety of fish and other sea-dwelling creatures.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T004', 'Electric', 'Eléctrico', 'There are relatively few Electric Pokémon; in fact only four were added in the third generation. Most are based on rodents or inanimate objects.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T005', 'Grass', 'Planta', 'Grass is one of the three basic elemental types along with Fire and Water, which constitute the three starter Pokémon. This creates a simple triangle to explain the type concept easily to new players.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T006', 'Ice', 'Hielo', 'Ice type Pokémon are now the rarest of all types: there are only around 60 in total (depending on how you count alternate forms or mega evolutions). They are ranked quite well defensively in terms of stats, although multiple type weaknesses let them down. Some are based on typical Arctic creatures like seals or yaks, while others are more mythical.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T007', 'Fighting', 'Lucha', 'Fighting Pokémon are strong and muscle-bound, often based on martial artists. Fighting moves are super-effective against five other types (as is Ground), making them very good offensively. Most Fighting type moves are in the Physical category, for obvious reasons.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T008', 'Poison', 'Veneno', 'The Poison type is regarded as one of the weakest offensively. Prior to Pokémon X/Y it was super-effective only against Grass (many of which are dual Poison so neutralizes the effect). It now has an extra advantage against the new Fairy type. In the first generation it was also super-effective against Bug but this was changed. It fares a little better defensively but its best advantage is through status moves like Toxic.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T009', 'Ground', 'Tierra', 'Ground is one of the strongest types offensively: it is super-effective against five other types (as is Fighting) and Earthquake is one of the strongest moves in the game with power and accuracy both 100. Unfortunately, many Ground type Pokémon are dual Rock types, lumbering them with 4x Grass and Water disadvantages.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T010', 'Flying', 'Volador', 'Most Flying type Pokémon are based on birds or insects, along with some mythical creatures like dragons. On average they are faster than any other type.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T011', 'Psychic', 'Psíquico', 'The Psychic type has few outright strengths, however, it also has few weaknesses. In the first generation it ended up being massively overpowered, mainly due to a complete lack of powerful Bug moves, its only weakness. Furthermore, a mistake in the game meant that Ghost-type moves had no effect on Psychic (although this only affected the low-powered Lick). Generation 2 rectified the situation with the addition of the Dark type along with better Pokémon and moves of all types.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T012', 'Bug', 'Bicho', 'Most Bug Pokémon grow quickly and evolve sooner than other types. As a result, they are often very weak. In Generation I, bugs were almost useless since the few Bug type moves available were very weak. The situation improved in later games with better moves and an advantage against the Dark type.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T013', 'Rock', 'Roca', 'Rock is a solid type as one might expect. Like Steel, Rock Pokémon usually have high defense - however, since many Rock Pokémon are part Ground they have a 4x weakness to both Grass and Water whose moves often come as Special type.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T014', 'Ghost', 'Fantasma', 'Ghosts are rare Pokémon, and the only type to have two immunities. In total there are just 34 Ghost type Pokémon (not including Megas/Formes), slightly above Ice.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T015', 'Dragon', 'Dragón', 'Dragons are among the most elusive and powerful of all Pokémon. Nine legendary Pokémon are part Dragon type and four have legendary-like stats.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T016', 'Dark', 'Siniestro', 'The Dark type was introduced in the second generation of Pokémon games as a measure to balance the types. In particular, its resistance to Psychic cut down that type''s advantage by a long way. When paired with the Ghost type it was the only type combination to have no weaknesses prior to Gen 6.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T017', 'Steel', 'Acero', 'The Steel type was introduced in the second generation of Pokémon games. It is the strongest type defensively, with 10 types being not very effective against it and the Poison type having no effect. From Pokémon X/Y onwards, it lost its Ghost and Dark resistance, those types now dealing neutral damage. The Steel type also has the highest average Defense stat in the games.
INSERT INTO public.tipos_pokemon VALUES ('T018', 'Fairy', 'Hada', 'The Fairy type was introduced in Generation 6 - the first new type for more than 12 years! Its main intention was to balance the type chart by reducing the power of dragons, while also giving an offensive boost to the Poison and Steel types. Several old Pokémon were retyped and new Pokémon introduced. There are only around 60 Fairy type Pokémon (depending on how you count alternate forms or mega evolutions), in total slightly above Ice.', 'El tipo Hada se introdujo en la Generación 6: ¡el primer tipo nuevo en más de 12 años! Su intención principal era equilibrar la tabla de tipos reduciendo el poder de los dragones, al tiempo que daba un impulso ofensivo a los tipos Veneno y Acero. Se reescribieron varios Pokémon antiguos y se introdujeron nuevos Pokémon. Solo hay alrededor de 60 Pokémon de tipo hada (dependiendo de cómo cuentes las formas alternativas o las megaevoluciones), en total ligeramente por encima de Ice.');
INSERT INTO public.movimiento VALUES ('MV00001', '10,000,000 Volt Thunderbolt', 'Gigarrayo Fulminante', 'Pikachu-exclusive Z-Move. High critical hit ratio.', 'Movimiento Z exclusivo de Pikachu. Alto porcentaje de golpes críticos.', '
